+# NW Agentic Tools Monorepo
+
+Greenfield monorepo for agentic tools: Python agents (core + business), FastAPI applications, and React UI libraries.
+
+## Structure
+
+- `libs/common/core` — shared runtime utilities (`nw-core`: channels, config, validation, calendar code; shared gRPC protos at `nw_core/channels/grpc/proto/`)
+- `tests` — shared feature scenarios and dev-only pytest utilities (`nw-common-tests`); see [`tests/README.md`](tests/README.md)
+- `libs/agents/toolkit` — shared agent framework (`nw-aglib-toolkit`: tools, pipeline config, agent clients)
+- `libs/ui/*` — React component libraries (`@nw/ui-bank-statement`)
+- `agents/core/*` — deployable core agents
+- `agents/business/*` — orchestration business agents
+- `apps/*/api` — Python FastAPI backends
+- `apps/*/web` — Next.js frontends
+
+## Agent architecture (channels vs core vs services)
+
+Each deployable agent separates **domain logic** from **external exposure**:
+
+| Layer | Location | Role |
+|-------|----------|------|
+| **`services/`** | `*ExtractorService.detect()` | In-process orchestration — chains pipeline phases or domain steps |
+| **`pipeline/`** (core) | `*Service.py`, models, config | Composable domain logic; `run_*` re-exported from `channels/tools/` |
+| **`channels/tools/`** | `*Tools.py`, `@tool` functions | Tool definitions exposed via REST, tools channel, LLM/MCP adapters |
+| **`channels/rest/`** | `*Route.py` | HTTP adapters calling the same `@tool` / `run_*` entry points |
+| **`core/agent.py`** | `BaseAgent.invoke()` | Optional in-process contract for app embedding — **not** a network channel |
+
+Registry wiring is centralized in `nw-aglib-toolkit` via `build_agent_channel_registry()`; each component's [`channels/registry.py`](agents/business/gift-extractor/src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/channels/registry.py) only names its REST router and tools package.
+
+**Orchestration options:**
+
+- **Custom (default):** `*ExtractorService.detect()` in one Python process (feature tests use this path).
+- **Temporal (future):** workflows call the same boundaries — either one activity per `run_*` phase tool or one activity for full `detect()`. No dependency on `core/agent.py`.
+- **LLM tool-caller:** tools channel schemas via `ChannelToolRegistry`.
+
+Primary exposure for business agents: domain REST (`POST /api/v1/.../detect`) + tools channel (`detect_*_candidates`). Generic `/invoke` via `BaseAgent` is optional and not wired by default.
+
+## Quick Start
+
+> **Windows:** the shell scripts below are bash-only. Follow [`SETUP.md`](SETUP.md)
+> for the PowerShell/WSL setup path. Use **Python 3.12.0** on Windows.
+
+```bash
+./scripts/bootstrap.sh      # uv sync --all-packages + pnpm + gRPC stubs
+# Do NOT use: uv run pip install -e ".[dev]" — root is not an installable package
+pnpm dev:echo:rest          # echo agent REST on :8001
+pnpm dev:bank-transactions:rest   # core bank-transactions pipeline on :8010
+pnpm dev:salary-extractor:rest    # salary business agent on :8020
+pnpm dev:app:api            # template API on :8080
+pnpm dev:app:web            # Next.js on :3000
+```
+
+## Testing
+
+### Prerequisites
+
+```bash
+./scripts/bootstrap.sh          # uv sync, pnpm install, and gRPC stub generation
+```
+
+### Run everything (full monorepo test suite)
+
+```bash
+# All Python tests (unit + feature + smoke + e2e where marked)
+uv run pytest
+
+# Convenience wrappers (markers from root pyproject.toml)
+pnpm test:unit                 # -m unit
+pnpm test:smoke                # -m smoke
+pnpm test:regression           # -m regression
+pnpm test:e2e                  # -m e2e
+pnpm test:feature              # root YAML scenario suite
+
+# UI + web
+pnpm test:ui:unit
+pnpm test:web:unit
+pnpm test:web:e2e
+```
+
+### Per-component unit tests
+
+Run from repo root with `uv run --package <pkg> pytest`:
+
+| Component | Package | Command |
+|-----------|---------|---------|
+| Core runtime | `nw-core` | `uv run --package nw-core pytest` |
+| Agent toolkit | `nw-aglib-toolkit` | `uv run --package nw-aglib-toolkit pytest` |
+| Common test utils | `nw-common-tests` | `uv run --package nw-common-tests pytest` |
+| Echo agent | `nw-agent-echo` | `uv run --package nw-agent-echo pytest` |
+| Bank-transactions | `nw-agcore-bank-transactions` | `uv run --package nw-agcore-bank-transactions pytest tests/unit` |
+| Salary extractor | `nw-agbus-salary-extractor` | `uv run --package nw-agbus-salary-extractor pytest tests/unit` |
+| Rent extractor | `nw-agbus-rent-extractor` | `uv run --package nw-agbus-rent-extractor pytest tests/unit` |
+| Gift extractor | `nw-agbus-gift-extractor` | `uv run --package nw-agbus-gift-extractor pytest tests/unit` |
+| Property-sale extractor | `nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor` | `uv run --package nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor pytest tests/unit` |
+| Template API | `nw-app-template-api` | `uv run --package nw-app-template-api pytest` |
+
+Bank-transactions coverage:
+
+```bash
+agents/core/bank-transactions/scripts/test_with_coverage.sh
+```
+
+Business extractor coverage (baseline gates; run from repo root):
+
+```bash
+agents/business/salary-extractor/scripts/test_with_coverage.sh      # ~51% line coverage
+agents/business/rent-extractor/scripts/test_with_coverage.sh          # ~53%
+agents/business/gift-extractor/scripts/test_with_coverage.sh          # ~55%
+agents/business/property-sale-extractor/scripts/test_with_coverage.sh # ~54%
+```
+
+### Feature tests by component
+
+| Component | Type | Command |
+|-----------|------|---------|
+| **Business extractors (YAML scenarios)** | Root runner | `uv run pytest tests/feature -m feature` |
+| | By module | `uv run pytest tests/feature --module=employment -m feature` |
+| | CLI filter | `python -m tests.feature.Runner --module rent "Rent_801_*"` |
+| | List scenarios | `pytest tests/feature --rw-list` |
+| **Bank-transactions pipeline REST** | Per-stage | `uv run --package nw-agcore-bank-transactions pytest tests/feature -m feature` |
+
+Scenario evidence JSON is written to `.plan/reviews/feature-outputs/{module}/{stem}.json`.
+
+Verbose TRACE logging (custom level 5 from `nw-core`) when debugging a single scenario:
+
+```bash
+uv run pytest tests/feature --module=property_sale -k Sale_847_MinimalCoveringSubset \
+  -v --log-cli-level=TRACE
+```
+
+Root [`tests/conftest.py`](tests/conftest.py) imports `nw_core.logging` so pytest recognizes `--log-cli-level=TRACE`. Alternatively pass the numeric level: `--log-cli-level=5`.
+
+
+## Environment
+
+Set `NW_ENV=dev|qa|uat|prod` (default `dev`). Each component loads `config/env.{NW_ENV}`.
+
+## Deployment
+
+Each agent/app has `config/deployment.yaml` controlling which exposures (REST, gRPC, MQ, tools) are active at runtime.
+
+## gRPC Codegen
+
+Per-component protos live under `src/<pkg>/channels/grpc/proto/`. Shared bank-transaction protos live in `libs/common/core/src/nw_core/channels/grpc/proto/`. Generate stubs:
+
+```bash
+bash scripts/generate_grpc.sh
+```
+
+Generated output: `nw_core/channels/grpc/generated/` (shared) and each business agent's `channels/grpc/generated/`. Bootstrap runs this automatically; re-run after changing any `.proto` file.
+
+## Scaffolding
+
+```bash
+./scripts/new_core_agent.sh my-agent
+./scripts/new_business_agent.sh my-biz-agent
+./scripts/new_app.sh my-app
+./scripts/new_ui_lib.sh my-ui
+```
