+uv run pytest -v -o log_cli=true --log-cli-level=INFO tests/feature/ `
+  --module=employment -k Reaworld_806_CrossDomainAdversaryPositive
+
+# List all discoverable scenarios without running them
+uv run pytest tests/feature --rw-list
+
+# pytest-free standalone runner
+python -m tests.feature.Runner --module rent "Rent_801_*"
+```
+
+Scenario evidence JSON is written to `.plan/reviews/feature-outputs/{module}/{stem}.json`.
+
+### Per-component unit tests
+
+```powershell
+uv run --package nw-core pytest
+uv run --package nw-aglib-toolkit pytest
+uv run --package nw-agcore-bank-transactions pytest tests/unit
+uv run --package nw-agbus-salary-extractor pytest tests/unit
+uv run --package nw-agbus-rent-extractor pytest tests/unit
+uv run --package nw-agbus-gift-extractor pytest tests/unit
+uv run --package nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor pytest tests/unit
+```
+
