+
+## 6. gRPC codegen (re-run after any `.proto` change)
+
+```powershell
+pwsh -File scripts/generate_grpc.ps1
+```
+
+Outputs shared stubs under `nw_core/channels/grpc/generated/` and per-agent stubs
+under each business agent's `channels/grpc/generated/`.
+
