+
+## 7. Troubleshooting
+
+| Symptom | Cause / fix |
+|---------|-------------|
+| `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named '...channels.grpc.generated'` | gRPC stubs not generated — run `pwsh -File scripts/generate_grpc.ps1`. |
+| `curl` returns an `Invoke-WebRequest` object / odd errors | Use `curl.exe` explicitly, or `Invoke-RestMethod`. |
+| `Activate.ps1 cannot be loaded` | `Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned`. |
+| `.sh` scaffolders (`new_*_agent.sh`) don't run | They are bash-only — use Git Bash or WSL. |
+| OpenCV / `cv2` import conflicts | Install `opencv-contrib-python` only; never alongside `opencv-python`. |
+| Port already in use | Another agent is running on that port (see §4 table); stop it or change `PORT` in the component's `config/env.dev`. |
