+# Gift Extractor Business Agent
+
+**Package:** `nw-agbus-gift-extractor` · **Module:** `nw_agbus_gift_extractor`  
+**Role:** End-to-end monetary gift detection — core **hint-grouping** path with gift-specific scoring. Requires `gift_hints.amount`. Returns up to 5 ranked candidates.
+
+Among business extractors, gift is the only one with **gRPC unit and feature tests**.
+
+**Package reference:** [`src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/README.md) · **Orchestration:** [`src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/services/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/services/README.md)
