+## High-level design (HLD)
+
+### Purpose
+
+Given a hinted gift amount (and optional donor/date hints), find credit transactions plausibly representing a monetary gift. Short pipeline: validation → normalization → features → hints → hint grouping → scoring → ranking. No skeleton/graph clustering or recurrence scoring.
+
+### System context
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph consumers [Consumers]
+        REST[REST clients]
+        TOOLS[LLM tool callers]
+        GRPC[gRPC tests]
+        FEAT[tests/feature gift module]
+    end
+
+    subgraph gift [nw-agbus-gift-extractor]
+        CH[channels rest tools grpc]
+        SVC[GiftTransactionExtractorService]
+        CH --> SVC
+    end
+
+    subgraph core [nw-agcore-bank-transactions]
+        HG[hint_grouping]
+        SC[run_score_hint_groups gift]
+        HINTS[GiftHintMatcher]
+    end
+
+    REST -->|POST /api/v1/gift/detect| CH
+    TOOLS -->|detect_gift_candidates| CH
+    GRPC -->|DetectGiftCandidates| CH
+    FEAT --> SVC
+    SVC --> HINTS --> HG --> SC
+```
+
+### Design principles
+
+| Principle | Implementation |
+|-----------|----------------|
+| Hint-grouping | `run_generate_hint_candidates` + `run_score_hint_groups` |
+| Amount required | `gift_hints.amount` mandatory |
+| Multi-candidate | Ranking cap defaults to 5 |
+| gRPC coverage | Servicer + converters + feature smoke test |
+
+### Channels (configured)
+
+From [`config/deployment.yaml`](config/deployment.yaml):
+
+| Channel | Enabled | Entry point |
+|---------|---------|-------------|
+| REST | ✅ | `POST /api/v1/gift/detect` |
+| Tools | ✅ | `detect_gift_candidates` |
+| gRPC | ✅ | `DetectGiftCandidates` (salary/rent/property-sale: ❌) |
+| MQ | ❌ | Not registered |
+
