+
+## Low-level design (LLD)
+
+### Agent layout
+
+```
+agents/business/gift-extractor/
+├── config/deployment.yaml   # grpc enabled
+├── src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/
+│   ├── app/           Bootstrap.py, Main.py
+│   ├── channels/      Registry.py, rest/, tools/, grpc/
+│   ├── core/          Agent.py, Orchestrator.py
+│   └── services/      GiftTransactionExtractorService.py, config/
+└── tests/
+    ├── unit/          test_orchestrator, test_grpc_converters
+    └── feature/       test_grpc_detect.py, scenarios/   # 39 YAML
+```
+
+PascalCase modules (`GiftDetectRoute.py`, `Converters.py`, …).
+
+### Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `app.Bootstrap` / `app.Main` | Settings, manifest, CLI → uvicorn/gRPC |
+| `channels.Registry` | REST + tools + gRPC registration |
+| `channels.rest.GiftDetectRoute` | `POST /api/v1/gift/detect` |
+| `channels.rest.RestRegistry` / `Router` | FastAPI router |
+| `channels.tools.GiftTransactionExtractorTools` | `@tool detect_gift_candidates` |
+| `channels.grpc.Servicer` / `Converters` / `GrpcRegistry` | gRPC detect handler |
+| `core.Orchestrator` / `core.Agent` | In-process facade + stub |
+| `services.GiftTransactionExtractorService` | Hint-grouping orchestrator |
+| `services.GiftRequestParsing` | JSON/proto → `BankTransactionRequest` |
+| `services.config.GiftConfig` | `gift_detector.yaml` + keywords |
+
+### Runtime bootstrap sequence
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant CLI as Main.py
+    participant BS as Bootstrap.build_runtime
+    participant AB as AgentChannelBootstrap
+
+    CLI->>BS: component_root, NW_ENV
+    BS->>AB: build(manifest, REST+tools+gRPC)
+    AB-->>CLI: AgentChannelRuntime
+    CLI->>CLI: uvicorn + gRPC if enabled
+```
+
+### Per-request REST flow
+
+Client → `GiftDetectRoute` → `detect_gift_candidates` → `GiftTransactionExtractorService.detect` → ranked candidates (max 5).
+
+---
+
+## Pipeline orchestration
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[gift_hints.amount] --> V[validation]
+    V --> N[normalization + features]
+    N --> H[gift hints]
+    H --> HG[hint_grouping profile=gift]
+    HG --> AP[apply_gift_hints]
+    AP --> SC[run_score_hint_groups]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords]
+    NK --> R[ranking max 5]
+    R --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+| Doc | What it covers |
+|-----|----------------|
+| [Core hint_grouping](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md) | Grouping algorithms |
+| [Core scoring](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) | `run_score_hint_groups` |
+| [services/README.md](src/nw_agbus_gift_extractor/services/README.md) | Agent orchestration |
+
+Default weights from `gift_detector.yaml`: amount minimum 0.35, exact amount bonus 0.15, gift keyword 0.20, donor hint 0.15, date proximity 0.10, payment channel 0.05. Date tolerance ±5 days.
