+# nw_agbus_gift_extractor
+
+**Package:** `nw-agbus-gift-extractor`  
+**Module:** `nw_agbus_gift_extractor`  
+**Role:** End-to-end monetary gift detection — uses hint-grouping and gift-specific scoring rather than the full salary recurrence pipeline.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Architecture](#architecture)
+- [Module index](#module-index)
+- [Orchestration summary](#orchestration-summary)
+- [Confidence scoring overview](#confidence-scoring-overview)
+- [Entry points](#entry-points)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Package layout](#package-layout)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+- [Further reading](#further-reading)
+
+---
+
+## Architecture
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph pkg [nw_agbus_gift_extractor]
+        Services[GiftTransactionExtractorService]
+        Channels[REST tools gRPC]
+    end
+
+    subgraph core [nw-agcore-bank-transactions]
+        HG[hint_grouping]
+        SC[run_score_hint_groups]
+    end
+
+    Channels --> Services
+    Services --> HG
+    Services --> SC
+```
+
+---
+
+## Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `services.GiftTransactionExtractorService` | Gift pipeline orchestrator |
+| `services.GiftRequestParsing` | JSON/proto → `BankTransactionRequest` |
+| `services.config.GiftConfig` | `gift_detector.yaml` + keywords |
+| `channels.rest.GiftDetectRoute` | `POST /api/v1/gift/detect` |
+| `channels.grpc.Servicer` | gRPC detect (gift has unit + feature gRPC tests) |
+
+---
+
+## Orchestration summary
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[gift_hints.amount required] --> V[validation]
+    V --> N[normalization + features]
+    N --> H[gift hints]
+    H --> HG[hint_grouping profile=gift]
+    HG --> AP[apply_gift_hints]
+    AP --> SC[run_score_hint_groups]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords]
+    NK --> R[ranking max 5 candidates]
+    R --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+Returns **multiple ranked** gift candidates when plausible alternates exist.  
+Detail: [`services/README.md`](services/README.md).  
+Core grouping: [`hint_grouping/README.md`](../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md).
+
+---
+
+## Confidence scoring overview
+
+| Component | Weight (default) |
+|-----------|------------------|
+| `amount_minimum_score` | 0.35 |
+| `exact_amount_bonus_weight` | 0.15 |
+| `gift_keyword_score` | 0.20 |
+| `donor_hint_bonus` | 0.15 |
+| `date_proximity_score` | 0.10 |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 |
+
+From `services/config/gift_detector.yaml`. Date proximity default ±5 calendar days.
+
