+# Gift Transaction Extractor Service
+
+**Module:** `nw_agbus_gift_extractor.services`  
+**Orchestrator:** `GiftTransactionExtractorService.detect`  
+**Role:** End-to-end UK monetary-gift detection — hint-amount grouping (`profile="gift"`), donor/date proximity scoring, and ranked multi-candidate output (max **5** returned).
+
+Package overview: [`../README.md`](../README.md).
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Purpose and system position](#purpose-and-system-position)
+- [Entry points](#entry-points)
+- [Inputs and outputs](#inputs-and-outputs)
+- [Orchestration flow](#orchestration-flow)
+- [Business logic algorithm](#business-logic-algorithm)
+- [Confidence scoring](#confidence-scoring)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Request parsing](#request-parsing)
+- [REST sequence diagram](#rest-sequence-diagram)
+- [Key source files](#key-source-files)
+- [Tests](#tests)
+
+---
+
+## Purpose and system position
+
+The gift extractor identifies **incoming monetary gift credits** on a recipient's UK bank statement. Unlike salary or rent, it does **not** use skeleton/graph recurrence clustering. Instead it follows the **hint-grouping path**:
+
+1. Group credits by amount-minimum (≥ hint), date window, and soft description match.
+2. Score groups via `run_score_hint_groups(profile="gift")`.
+3. Return up to **5** ranked candidates when multiple plausible gifts exist.
+
+| Layer | Responsibility |
+|-------|----------------|
+| **Core hint_grouping** | `run_generate_hint_candidates(profile="gift")` |
+| **Core scoring** | `run_score_hint_groups(profile="gift")` |
+| **This service** | Required `gift_hints.amount` gate, gift applicator, gift YAML weights, ranking cap |
+
+---
+
+## Entry points
+
+### Tool (`@tool`)
+
+```python
+from nw_agbus_gift_extractor.channels.tools.GiftTransactionExtractorTools import (
+    detect_gift_candidates,
+)
+from nw_agbus_gift_extractor.services import BankTransactionRequest
+
+result = detect_gift_candidates(payload)
+```
+
+| Property | Value |
+|----------|-------|
+| Tool name | `detect_gift_candidates` |
+| Category | `banking.gift` |
+| Wrapper class | `GiftTransactionExtractorTools` |
+
+### REST
+
+| Property | Value |
+|----------|-------|
+| Method | `POST` |
+| Path | `/api/v1/gift/detect` |
+| Route class | `GiftDetectRoute` |
+| Request model | `DetectGiftRequest` |
+| Response model | `DetectGiftSuccessResponse` |
+| OpenAPI | `channels/rest/openapi/detect_gift_candidates.openapi.yaml` |
+
+### gRPC
+
+| Property | Value |
+|----------|-------|
+| Service | `nw.gift.v1.GiftExtractor` |
+| RPC | `DetectGiftCandidates` |
+| Servicer | `GiftExtractorServicer` |
+| Proto | `channels/grpc/proto/nw/gift/v1/gift_extractor.proto` |
+
+Gift is the only business extractor with dedicated gRPC unit and feature Python tests.
+
+---
+
+## Inputs and outputs
+
+### Request — `BankTransactionRequest`
+
+Gift detection requires `hint_inputs.gift_hints` with a valid **`amount`** field. Missing amount triggers early exit with warning `MISSING_GIFT_AMOUNT`.
+
+### Hint block — `gift_hints`
+
+| Field | Required | Default | Purpose |
+|-------|----------|---------|---------|
+| `amount` | **Yes** | — | Minimum expected gift amount (`>=` grouping) |
+| `expected_date` | No | — | Target gift date (ISO) |
+| `tolerance_days` | No | **5** | ± calendar days for date score and grouping window |
+| `donor_name` | No | — | Token overlap via employer-style matcher |
+| `allow_multi_transaction` | No | `true` | Allow partial aggregation across same-day credits |
+
+### Response — `BankTransactionResult`
+
+| Field | Gift-specific notes |
+|-------|---------------------|
+| `candidate_sets` | Up to **5** ranked `GiftCandidateSet` groups |
+| `rejected_or_near_miss_sets` | Weaker matches, negative gift keywords |
+| `applied_hints` | `AppliedHints.gift` — donor match level, date proximity, aggregate sum |
+| `warnings` | `MISSING_GIFT_AMOUNT` on invalid hint block |
+
+### Sample REST request
+
+```json
+{
+  "analysis_id": "gift_demo",
+  "gift_hints": {
+    "amount": 5000,
+    "expected_date": "2024-03-10",
+    "tolerance_days": 5,
+    "donor_name": "JANE SMITH"
+  },
+  "transactions": [
+    {
+      "id": "t1",
+      "date": "2024-03-10",
+      "description": "MONETARY GIFT FROM MUM",
+      "credit_amount": "5000.00",
+      "debit_amount": 0
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+JSON Schema: `schemas/gift_input.schema.json`.
+
+---
+
+## Orchestration flow
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[BankTransactionRequest] --> GATE{gift_hints.amount present?}
+    GATE -->|no| OUT0[Early exit MISSING_GIFT_AMOUNT]
+    GATE --> V[validation]
+    V -->|early_exit| OUT1[Empty result]
+    V --> N[normalization]
+    N --> F[feature_extraction]
+    F --> H[core hints]
+    H --> HG[run_generate_hint_candidates profile=gift]
+    HG --> AH[apply_gift_hints]
+    AH --> SC[run_score_hint_groups profile=gift]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords partition]
+    NK --> RK[ranking max 5]
+    RK --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+---
+
+## Business logic algorithm
+
+`GiftTransactionExtractorService.detect()` executes:
+
+1. **Initialise** — Load `GiftConfig`, `GiftHintMatcher`, calendar, audit builder.
+2. **Validate gift amount** — Require `payload.hint_inputs.gift_hints`; call `GiftHintMatcher.validate_amount_present`. Early exit on failure.
+3. **Validate transactions** — `run_validate_bank_transaction_payload(to_validation_payload(payload))`.
+4. **Normalise** — Credit-only rows.
+5. **Extract features** — Gift description signals from `gift_keywords.yaml`.
+6. **Apply core hints** — Shared hint infrastructure (no salary/rent-specific applicators).
+7. **Hint grouping** — `run_generate_hint_candidates(normalised, profile="gift", hint_inputs=gift_hint_inputs, hint_matcher=...)`. Produces `HintGroupCandidate` list ordered by aggregate sum / fit.
+8. **Resolve expected date** — `GiftHintMatcher.resolve_expected_date` for scoring window.
+9. **Apply gift hints** — `apply_gift_hints(...)` on primary cluster → `AppliedHints(gift=...)`.
+10. **Score groups** — `run_score_hint_groups(groups, profile="gift", weights=..., thresholds=..., hint_matcher=...)`.
+11. **Negative keywords** — Partition gift-adversarial descriptions (rent, salary, etc.).
+12. **Rank** — `run_rank_candidates` with default `max_candidates_to_return=5` from YAML ranking section.
+
+Partial multi-transaction gifts: when `allow_multi_transaction=true`, grouping aggregates same-window credits whose sum ≥ hint amount.
+
+---
+
+## Confidence scoring
+
+Gift uses **`run_score_hint_groups`** with `profile="gift"`. Weights from `config/gift_detector.yaml`.
+
+### Composite weights
+
+| Component | Weight |
+|-----------|--------|
+| `amount_minimum_score` | **0.35** |
+| `exact_amount_bonus_weight` | **0.15** |
+| `gift_keyword_score` | **0.20** |
+| `donor_hint_bonus` | **0.15** |
+| `date_proximity_score` | **0.10** |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 |
+
+### Thresholds and ranking
+
+| Key | Value |
+|-----|-------|
+| `return_threshold` | 0.40 |
+| `probable_gift` | 0.55 |
+| `possible_gift` | 0.40 |
+| `max_candidates_to_return` | **5** |
+| `max_near_misses` | 5 |
+
+### Hint bonuses (`gift_hints` section)
+
+| Key | Value | Purpose |
+|-----|-------|---------|
+| `donor_exact_match_floor` | 0.92 | Floor when donor name exact match |
+| `donor_partial_match_floor` | 0.85 | Partial token overlap |
+| `exact_amount_bonus` | 0.15 | Single-txn exact amount |
+| `exact_aggregate_bonus` | 0.10 | Multi-txn aggregate exact match |
+| `overpayment_modifier` | 0.95 | Slight penalty for overpayment |
+| `default_tolerance_days` | 5 | Date proximity window |
+
+Formula details: core [`pipeline/scoring/README.md`](../../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) — **Scoring profiles → gift**.
+
+Grouping strategy: core [`pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md`](../../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md) — **Gift grouping strategy**.
+
