+
+## Configuration
+
+### `config/gift_detector.yaml`
+
+Sections: `weights`, `thresholds`, `ranking`, `gift_hints` (see scoring table above).
+
+### `config/gift_keywords.yaml`
+
+| Key | Purpose |
+|-----|---------|
+| `positive_keywords` | GIFT, MONETARY GIFT, FAMILY TRUST, … |
+| `negative_keywords` | RENT, SALARY, LOAN, … (adversarial) |
+
+### `config/GiftConfig.py`
+
+Loads YAML, exposes `weights()`, `thresholds()`, `gift_hints()`, `config_overrides_for_core()`, and `description_signals()`.
+
