+## REST sequence diagram
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant Client
+    participant Route as GiftDetectRoute
+    participant Parse as GiftRequestParsing
+    participant Tool as detect_gift_candidates
+    participant Svc as GiftTransactionExtractorService
+    participant Core as nw_agcore_bank_transactions
+
+    Client->>Route: POST /api/v1/gift/detect
+    Route->>Parse: gift_request_from_mapping(body)
+    Parse-->>Route: BankTransactionRequest
+    Route->>Tool: detect_gift_candidates(payload)
+    Tool->>Svc: detect(payload)
+    alt missing gift_hints.amount
+        Svc-->>Tool: early exit + MISSING_GIFT_AMOUNT
+    else
+        Svc->>Core: validation → features
+        Svc->>Core: run_generate_hint_candidates(profile=gift)
+        Svc->>Core: run_score_hint_groups(profile=gift)
+        Svc->>Core: ranking (max 5)
+    end
+    Svc-->>Tool: BankTransactionResult
+    Tool-->>Route: result
+    Route-->>Client: JSON { ok, result }
+```
