+# Property Sale Extractor Business Agent
+
+**Package:** `nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor` · **Module:** `nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor`  
+**Role:** End-to-end property sale proceeds detection — core **hint-grouping** path with partial-payment tolerance, timeline hints, and amount-coverage scoring. Returns at most **one** ranked candidate.
+
+**Package reference:** [`src/nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor/README.md) · **Orchestration:** [`src/nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor/services/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor/services/README.md)
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [High-level design (HLD)](#high-level-design-hld)
+- [Low-level design (LLD)](#low-level-design-lld)
+- [Pipeline orchestration](#pipeline-orchestration)
+- [Setup and run](#setup-and-run)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+- [Related components](#related-components)
+- [Further reading](#further-reading)
+
+---
+
+## High-level design (HLD)
+
+### Purpose
+
+Given sale hints (expected proceeds, buyer/property references, timeline window), identify credit transactions plausibly representing property sale proceeds. Supports partial payments within a timeline and scores by amount coverage across multiple transactions.
+
+### System context
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph consumers [Consumers]
+        REST[REST clients]
+        TOOLS[LLM tool callers]
+        FEAT[tests/feature property_sale module]
+    end
+
+    subgraph sale [nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor]
+        CH[channels rest tools]
+        SVC[PropertySaleTransactionExtractorService]
+        CH --> SVC
+    end
+
+    subgraph core [nw-agcore-bank-transactions]
+        HG[hint_grouping property_sale]
+        SC[run_score_hint_groups]
+        HINTS[PropertySaleHintMatcher]
+    end
+
+    REST -->|POST /api/v1/property_sale/detect| CH
+    TOOLS -->|detect_property_sale_candidates| CH
+    FEAT --> SVC
+    SVC --> HINTS --> HG --> SC
+```
+
+### Design principles
+
+| Principle | Implementation |
+|-----------|----------------|
+| Hint-grouping | `run_generate_hint_candidates(profile=property_sale)` |
+| Partial payments | Amount tolerance ±10% default; multi-txn coverage |
+| Timeline hints | Default `15d` window from reference date |
+| Single candidate | Ranking cap defaults to 1 |
+
+### Channels (configured)
+
+From [`config/deployment.yaml`](config/deployment.yaml):
+
+| Channel | Enabled | Entry point |
+|---------|---------|-------------|
+| REST | ✅ | `POST /api/v1/property_sale/detect` |
+| Tools | ✅ | `detect_property_sale_candidates` |
+| gRPC | ❌ | Stub present; not registered |
+| MQ | ❌ | Not registered |
+
+---
+
+## Low-level design (LLD)
+
+### Agent layout
+
+```
+agents/business/property-sale-extractor/
+├── config/deployment.yaml, env.*
+├── src/nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor/
+│   ├── app/           Bootstrap.py, Main.py
+│   ├── channels/      Registry.py, rest/, tools/, grpc/
+│   ├── core/          Agent.py, Orchestrator.py
+│   └── services/      PropertySaleTransactionExtractorService.py, config/
+└── tests/unit/, feature/scenarios/   # 57 YAML scenarios
+```
+
+PascalCase modules (`PropertySaleDetectRoute.py`, `Bootstrap.py`, …).
+
+### Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `app.Bootstrap` / `app.Main` | Settings, manifest, CLI → uvicorn |
+| `channels.Registry` | `build_agent_channel_registry` wrapper |
+| `channels.rest.PropertySaleDetectRoute` | `POST /api/v1/property_sale/detect` |
+| `channels.rest.RestRegistry` / `Router` | FastAPI router |
+| `channels.tools.PropertySaleTransactionExtractorTools` | `@tool detect_property_sale_candidates` |
+| `channels.grpc.*` | gRPC stub (disabled by default) |
+| `core.Orchestrator` / `core.Agent` | In-process facade + stub |
+| `services.PropertySaleTransactionExtractorService` | Sale hint-grouping orchestrator |
+| `services.PropertySaleRequestParsing` | JSON/proto → `BankTransactionRequest` |
+| `services.config.PropertySaleConfig` | `property_sale_detector.yaml` + keywords |
+
+### Runtime bootstrap sequence
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant CLI as Main.py
+    participant BS as Bootstrap.build_runtime
+    participant AB as AgentChannelBootstrap
+
+    CLI->>BS: component_root, NW_ENV
+    BS->>AB: build(manifest, register_channels)
+    AB-->>CLI: AgentChannelRuntime
+    CLI->>CLI: uvicorn if REST enabled
+```
+
+### Per-request REST flow
+
+Client → `PropertySaleDetectRoute` → `detect_property_sale_candidates` → `PropertySaleTransactionExtractorService.detect` → single best candidate.
+
+---
+
+## Pipeline orchestration
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[sale_hints] --> V[validation]
+    V --> N[normalization + features]
+    N --> H[property sale hints]
+    H --> HG[hint_grouping profile=property_sale]
+    HG --> AP[apply_property_sale_hints]
+    AP --> SC[run_score_hint_groups]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords]
+    NK --> R[ranking max 1]
+    R --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+| Doc | What it covers |
+|-----|----------------|
+| [Core hint_grouping](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md) | Grouping algorithms |
+| [Core scoring](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) | `run_score_hint_groups` |
+| [services/README.md](src/nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor/services/README.md) | Agent orchestration |
+
+Default weights from `property_sale_detector.yaml`: amount coverage 0.50, per-txn fit 0.10, description 0.15, buyer hint 0.10, property hint 0.10, timeline 0.10, payment channel 0.05. Tolerance ±10%; timeline `15d`.
+
