+## Setup and run
+
+**Prerequisites:** Python ≥ 3.12, [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), `uv sync --all-packages`.
+
+| File | Dev settings |
+|------|-------------|
+| `config/env.dev` | `HOST=127.0.0.1`, `PORT=8023`, `GRPC_PORT=5023`, `LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG` |
+
+```bash
+pnpm dev:property-sale-extractor:rest
+# or:
+uv run --package nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor python -m nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor.app.Main --env dev
+```
+
+OpenAPI: `http://127.0.0.1:8023/docs`
+
+```bash
+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8023/api/v1/property_sale/detect \
+  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
+  -d '{"analysis_id":"demo","transactions":[{"id":"t1","date":"2024-06-15","description":"SOLICITOR PROCEEDS","credit_amount":"250000.00","debit_amount":0}],"hint_inputs":{"property_sale_hints":{"amount":"250000","timeline_hint":"15d"}}}' | jq .
+```
