+---
+
+## Orchestration summary
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[sale_hints] --> V[validation]
+    V --> N[normalization + features]
+    N --> H[property sale hints]
+    H --> HG[hint_grouping profile=property_sale]
+    HG --> AP[apply_property_sale_hints]
+    AP --> SC[run_score_hint_groups]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords]
+    NK --> R[ranking max 1 candidate]
+    R --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+Supports partial payments in timeline, amount-coverage scoring, and buyer/property hint bonuses.  
+Detail: [`services/README.md`](services/README.md).
