+# gRPC channel — property sale extractor
+
+Naming and codegen conventions for this agent's gRPC surface.
+
+## Layout
+
+```
+channels/grpc/
+├── proto/nw/property_sale/v1/property_sale_extractor.proto
+├── generated/nw/property_sale/v1/
+│   ├── property_sale_extractor_pb2.py
+│   └── property_sale_extractor_pb2_grpc.py
+├── Converters.py
+├── Servicer.py
+└── GrpcRegistry.py
+```
+
+## Naming policy
+
+| Layer | Convention | Examples |
+|-------|------------|----------|
+| **Hand-written Python** | PascalCase module filenames | `Converters.py`, `Servicer.py`, `GrpcRegistry.py` |
+| **Proto files** | snake_case path + message names | `property_sale_extractor.proto`, `DetectPropertySaleCandidatesRequest` |
+| **Generated Python** | protoc defaults (snake_case modules) | `property_sale_extractor_pb2.py`, `property_sale_extractor_pb2_grpc.py` |
+| **RPC methods** | PascalCase in `.proto` | `DetectPropertySaleCandidates` |
+
+Do **not** rename generated `*_pb2*.py` files or proto package paths.
+
+## Codegen
+
+```bash
+./scripts/generate_grpc.sh
+```
+
+Regenerates shared `nw_core` stubs and this agent's `channels/grpc/generated/` output. Edit `proto/` and hand-written modules only.
+
+## Shared helpers
+
+`nw_aglib_toolkit.channels.grpc.DetectRpc` provides detect-handler scaffolding (context, errors, result serialisation).
+
+## Testing
+
+```bash
+uv run --package nw-agbus-property-sale-extractor pytest agents/business/property-sale-extractor/tests/unit -m unit -k grpc
+```
