+# Property Sale Transaction Extractor Service
+
+**Module:** `nw_agbus_property_sale_extractor.services`  
+**Orchestrator:** `PropertySaleTransactionExtractorService.detect`  
+**Role:** End-to-end UK property-sale proceeds detection — hint-amount grouping (`profile="property_sale"`), partial-payment aggregation, timeline window scoring, and **single** best candidate return (max **1**).
+
+Package overview: [`../README.md`](../README.md).
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Purpose and system position](#purpose-and-system-position)
+- [Entry points](#entry-points)
+- [Inputs and outputs](#inputs-and-outputs)
+- [Orchestration flow](#orchestration-flow)
+- [Business logic algorithm](#business-logic-algorithm)
+- [Confidence scoring](#confidence-scoring)
