+## Inputs and outputs
+
+### Request — `BankTransactionRequest`
+
+Property-sale detection requires `hint_inputs.property_sale_hints` (JSON key `sale_hints`) with a valid **`amount`**. Missing amount → early exit with `MISSING_SALE_AMOUNT`.
+
+### Hint block — `sale_hints` / `property_sale_hints`
+
+| Field | Required | Default | Purpose |
+|-------|----------|---------|---------|
+| `amount` | **Yes** | — | Expected total sale proceeds |
+| `tolerance_pct` | No | **10%** | Symmetric band `[H×(1−T), H×(1+T)]` |
+| `timeline_hint` | No | **`15d`** | Symmetric ±span around reference date |
+| `reference_date` / `sale_date` | No | group start | Anchor for timeline window |
+| `buyer_name` | No | — | Token overlap (exact/partial) |
+| `property_ref` | No | — | Property reference match |
+| `location` | No | — | Location substring |
+| `postcode` | No | — | Postcode token match |
+
+### Response — `BankTransactionResult`
+
+| Field | Property-sale notes |
+|-------|---------------------|
+| `candidate_sets` | **At most 1** best `PropertySaleCandidateSet` |
+| `rejected_or_near_miss_sets` | Alternative groups, below threshold, adversarial keywords |
+| `applied_hints` | `AppliedHints.property_sale` — buyer match, timeline window, aggregate sum |
+| `warnings` | `MISSING_SALE_AMOUNT`, validation warnings |
+
+### Sample REST request
+
+```json
+{
+  "analysis_id": "sale_demo",
+  "sale_hints": {
+    "amount": 250000,
+    "tolerance_pct": 0.10,
