+## Orchestration flow
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[BankTransactionRequest] --> GATE{sale_hints.amount present?}
+    GATE -->|no| OUT0[Early exit MISSING_SALE_AMOUNT]
+    GATE --> V[validation]
+    V -->|early_exit| OUT1[Empty result]
+    V --> N[normalization]
+    N --> F[feature_extraction]
+    F --> H[core hints]
+    H --> HG[run_generate_hint_candidates profile=property_sale]
+    HG --> AH[apply_property_sale_hints]
+    AH --> SC[run_score_hint_groups profile=property_sale]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords partition]
+    NK --> RK[ranking max 1]
+    RK --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+---
+
+## Business logic algorithm
+
+`PropertySaleTransactionExtractorService.detect()` executes:
+
+1. **Initialise** — Load `PropertySaleConfig`, `PropertySaleHintMatcher`, calendar, audit.
+2. **Validate sale amount** — Require `property_sale_hints`; `validate_amount_present`. Early exit on failure.
+3. **Validate transactions** — Core validation via `to_validation_payload`.
+4. **Normalise** — Credit-only rows.
+5. **Extract features** — Seller-side keywords from `property_sale_keywords.yaml`.
+6. **Apply core hints** — Shared hint pass.
+7. **Hint grouping** — `run_generate_hint_candidates(profile="property_sale", ...)`. Groups credits whose amounts fall in ±% band and dates in symmetric timeline window. Supports **partial payments** summing to hint amount.
+8. **Resolve timeline** — `resolve_reference_date` and `resolve_window(reference, sale_hints)` for applied-hint audit.
+9. **Apply sale hints** — `apply_property_sale_hints(...)` on primary group → `AppliedHints(property_sale=...)`.
+10. **Score groups** — `run_score_hint_groups(profile="property_sale", applied_hints=..., ...)`.
+11. **Negative keywords** — Partition rent/salary/gift adversaries.
+12. **Rank** — `run_rank_candidates` with `max_candidates_to_return=1` from YAML.
+
+When multiple partial payments exist within the timeline window, grouping selects the minimal covering subset whose aggregate sum best matches the hint amount.
+
+---
+
+## Confidence scoring
+
+Property-sale uses **`run_score_hint_groups`** with `profile="property_sale"`. Weights from `config/property_sale_detector.yaml`.
+
+### Composite weights
+
+| Component | Weight |
+|-----------|--------|
+| `amount_coverage_score` | **0.50** |
+| `timeline_fit_score` | **0.10** |
+| `description_keyword_score` | 0.15 |
+| `per_txn_amount_fit_score` | 0.10 |
+| `buyer_hint_bonus` | 0.10 |
+| `property_hint_bonus` | 0.10 |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 |
+
+### Thresholds and ranking
+
+| Key | Value |
+|-----|-------|
+| `return_threshold` | 0.40 |
+| `probable_property_sale` | 0.55 |
+| `possible_property_sale` | 0.40 |
+| `max_candidates_to_return` | **1** |
+| `max_near_misses` | 5 |
+
+### Sale hint defaults (`sale_hints` section)
+
+| Key | Default | Purpose |
+|-----|---------|---------|
+| `default_tolerance_pct` | 0.10 | ±10% amount band |
+| `default_timeline_hint` | `"15d"` | ±15 calendar days |
+| `buyer_exact_match_floor` | 0.92 | Buyer name exact match |
+| `buyer_partial_match_floor` | 0.85 | Partial overlap |
+| `buyer_match_min_base_score` | 0.45 | Minimum base before floor applies |
+
+Formula details: core [`pipeline/scoring/README.md`](../../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) — **Scoring profiles → property_sale**.
+
+Grouping (partial payments, timeline window): core [`pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md`](../../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md) — **Property sale grouping strategy**.
