+# Rent Extractor Business Agent
+
+**Package:** `nw-agbus-rent-extractor` · **Module:** `nw_agbus_rent_extractor`  
+**Role:** End-to-end UK rental-income detection — recurrence-focused pipeline subset with rent hints, multi-stream recovery, and `RecurrenceProfile=rent` scoring.
+
+Phase algorithms live in [`nw-agcore-bank-transactions`](../../core/bank-transactions/) — not duplicated here.
+
+**Package reference:** [`src/nw_agbus_rent_extractor/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_rent_extractor/README.md) · **Orchestration:** [`src/nw_agbus_rent_extractor/services/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_rent_extractor/services/README.md)
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [High-level design (HLD)](#high-level-design-hld)
+- [Low-level design (LLD)](#low-level-design-lld)
+- [Pipeline orchestration](#pipeline-orchestration)
+- [Setup and run](#setup-and-run)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+- [Related components](#related-components)
+- [Further reading](#further-reading)
+
+---
+
+## High-level design (HLD)
+
+### Purpose
+
+Identify recurring rental-income credit streams from bank transactions with optional rent hints (amount, property, postcode). Handles multi-property landlords where graph dedup might collapse distinct streams via agent-specific `_recover_distinct_rent_streams`.
+
+### System context
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph consumers [Consumers]
+        REST[REST clients]
+        TOOLS[LLM tool callers]
+        FEAT[tests/feature rent module]
+    end
+
+    subgraph rent [nw-agbus-rent-extractor]
+        CH[channels rest tools]
+        SVC[RentTransactionExtractorService]
+        CH --> SVC
+    end
+
+    subgraph core [nw-agcore-bank-transactions]
+        PIPE[validation hints skeleton graph scoring]
+        REC[run_score_recurrence_pool rent]
+    end
+
+    REST -->|POST /api/v1/rent/detect| CH
+    TOOLS -->|detect_rent_candidates| CH
+    FEAT --> SVC
+    SVC --> PIPE
+    SVC --> REC
+```
+
+### Design principles
+
+| Principle | Implementation |
+|-----------|----------------|
+| Recurrence path | `run_score_recurrence_pool(profile=rent)` — not full salary scoring |
+| Stream recovery | `_recover_distinct_rent_streams` after graph dedup |
+| Rent hints | `RentHintMatcher` + `apply_rent_hints` from core |
+| Composite deployment | Embeds core; suppresses duplicate REST/tools |
+
+### Channels (configured)
+
+From [`config/deployment.yaml`](config/deployment.yaml):
+
+| Channel | Enabled | Entry point |
+|---------|---------|-------------|
+| REST | ✅ | `POST /api/v1/rent/detect` |
+| Tools | ✅ | `detect_rent_candidates` |
+| gRPC | ❌ | Stub present; not registered |
+| MQ | ❌ | Not registered |
+
