+
+## Low-level design (LLD)
+
+### Agent layout
+
+```
+agents/business/rent-extractor/
+├── config/deployment.yaml, env.*
+├── src/nw_agbus_rent_extractor/
+│   ├── app/           Bootstrap.py, Main.py
+│   ├── channels/      Registry.py, rest/, tools/, grpc/
+│   ├── core/          Agent.py, Orchestrator.py
+│   └── services/      RentTransactionExtractorService.py, config/
+└── tests/unit/, feature/scenarios/   # 75 YAML scenarios
+```
+
+PascalCase modules (`RentDetectRoute.py`, `Bootstrap.py`, …).
+
+### Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `app.Bootstrap` / `app.Main` | Settings, manifest, Typer CLI → uvicorn |
+| `channels.Registry` | `build_agent_channel_registry` wrapper |
+| `channels.rest.RentDetectRoute` | `POST /api/v1/rent/detect` |
+| `channels.rest.RestRegistry` / `Router` | FastAPI router assembly |
+| `channels.tools.RentTransactionExtractorTools` | `@tool detect_rent_candidates` |
+| `channels.grpc.*` | gRPC stub (disabled by default) |
+| `core.Orchestrator` / `core.Agent` | In-process facade + `BaseAgent` stub |
+| `services.RentTransactionExtractorService` | Rent pipeline + stream recovery |
+| `services.RentRequestParsing` | JSON/proto → `BankTransactionRequest` |
+| `services.config.RentConfig` | `rent_detector.yaml` + keywords |
+
+### Runtime bootstrap sequence
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant CLI as Main.py
+    participant BS as Bootstrap.build_runtime
+    participant M as deployment.yaml
+    participant AB as AgentChannelBootstrap
+
+    CLI->>BS: component_root, NW_ENV
+    BS->>M: load manifest
+    BS->>AB: build(manifest, register_channels)
+    AB-->>CLI: AgentChannelRuntime
+    CLI->>CLI: uvicorn if REST enabled
+```
+
+### Per-request REST flow
+
+Client → `RentDetectRoute` → `detect_rent_candidates` → `RentTransactionExtractorService.detect` → `BankTransactionResult` JSON.
+
+---
+
+## Pipeline orchestration
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[rent_hints] --> V[validation]
+    V --> N[normalization + features]
+    N --> H[rent hints]
+    H --> S[skeleton_grouping]
+    H --> G[graph_clustering]
+    S --> D[dedup]
+    G --> D
+    D --> RCV[_recover_distinct_rent_streams]
+    RCV --> FB[amount_date_fallback]
+    FB --> SC[run_score_recurrence_pool rent]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords]
+    NK --> RK[ranking]
+    RK --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+**Skipped vs salary:** bonus/expense split, employment transition, `run_score_candidate_pool`.
+
+| Doc | What it covers |
+|-----|----------------|
+| [Core pipeline](../../core/bank-transactions/README.md#pipeline-phases) | Shared phase algorithms |
+| [Core hints (rent)](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hints/README.md) | `RentHintMatcher` |
+| [Core scoring](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) | `RecurrenceProfile.RENT` |
+| [services/README.md](src/nw_agbus_rent_extractor/services/README.md) | Recovery logic detail |
+
+Default scoring weights from `rent_detector.yaml`: date pattern 0.35, amount consistency 0.35, description 0.15, coverage 0.10, payment channel 0.05. Thresholds: `return_threshold` 0.40, `probable_rent` 0.55.
