+## Orchestration summary
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[BankTransactionRequest + rent_hints] --> V[validation]
+    V --> N[normalization + features]
+    N --> H[rent hints]
+    H --> S[skeleton_grouping]
+    H --> G[graph_clustering]
