+## Confidence scoring overview
+
+| Component | Weight (default) | Notes |
+|-----------|------------------|-------|
+| `date_pattern_score` | 0.35 | Recurrence fit from core |
+| `amount_consistency_score` | 0.35 | Stable rent amount |
+| `description_similarity_score` | 0.15 | Rent keywords |
+| `coverage_score` | 0.10 | Month coverage |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 | BACS/Faster Payments |
