+{
+  "analysis_id": "rent_demo",
+  "candidate_sets": [],
+  "rejected_or_near_miss_sets": [],
+  "warnings": [],
+  "applied_hints": {
+    "rent": {
+      "amount_matched": true,
+      "rentee_match_level": "none"
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+JSON Schema: `schemas/rent_input.schema.json`.
+
+---
+
+## Orchestration flow
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[BankTransactionRequest] --> V[validation]
+    V -->|early_exit| OUT0[Empty result]
+    V --> N[normalization]
+    N --> F[feature_extraction]
+    F --> H[core hints + rent applicator]
+    H --> SK[skeleton_grouping]
+    H --> GR[graph_clustering]
+    SK --> DD[dedup_candidate_pool]
+    GR --> DD
+    DD --> REC[_recover_distinct_rent_streams]
+    REC --> FB[amount_date_fallback]
+    FB --> SC[run_score_recurrence_pool profile=rent]
+    SC --> NK[negative_keywords partition]
+    NK --> RK[ranking]
+    RK --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+---
+
+## Business logic algorithm
+
+`RentTransactionExtractorService.detect()` executes:
+
+1. **Initialise** — Load `RentConfig`, merge overrides into `AppConfig`, build `RentHintMatcher` and working-day calendar.
+2. **Validate** — `run_validate_bank_transaction_payload(to_validation_payload(payload))`. Map core warnings via `rent_warning_from_salary`.
+3. **Normalise** — Credit-only normalised transactions.
+4. **Extract features** — Rent description signals from `rent_keywords.yaml`.
+5. **Apply core hints** — `run_apply_bank_transaction_hints` for shared hint infrastructure.
+6. **Apply rent hints** — `apply_rent_hints(normalised, rent_hint_inputs, RentHintMatcher)` → `AppliedHints(rent=...)`.
+7. **Skeleton candidates** — `run_emit_skeleton_candidates` with rent-tuned `candidate_generation` thresholds.
+8. **Graph candidates** — `run_graph_clustering`.
+9. **Dedup** — `run_dedup_candidate_pool` at configured overlap threshold (default 0.90).
+10. **Recover distinct streams** — `_recover_distinct_rent_streams(pool, skeleton_candidates)` splits merged graph clusters when multiple skeleton streams with different amounts were incorrectly deduped (multi-property landlords).
+11. **Amount/date fallback** — `run_amount_date_fallback` on unaccounted credits; append to pool.
+12. **Recurrence scoring** — `run_score_recurrence_pool(profile="rent", rent_weights=..., rent_thresholds=..., rent_hint_matcher=...)`.
+13. **Negative keywords** — `partition_by_negative_keywords` (deposit-refund negatives from rent keywords).
+14. **Rank and return** — `run_rank_candidates` with effective caps from config or request overrides.
+
+---
+
+## Confidence scoring
+
+Rent uses **`run_score_recurrence_pool`** with `profile="rent"`. Weights and thresholds are loaded from `config/rent_detector.yaml` and passed explicitly to the scoring tool.
+
+### Composite weights (`rent_detector.yaml`)
+
+| Component | Weight |
+|-----------|--------|
+| `date_pattern_score` | **0.35** |
+| `amount_consistency_score` | **0.35** |
+| `description_similarity_score` | 0.15 |
+| `coverage_score` | 0.10 |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 |
+
+### Thresholds
+
+| Key | Value | Purpose |
+|-----|-------|---------|
+| `return_threshold` | 0.40 | Minimum to return |
+| `probable_rent` | 0.55 | Classification band |
+| `possible_rent` | 0.40 | Weaker stream label |
+
+### Rent hint match floors
+
+| Key | Value |
+|-----|-------|
+| `rentee_exact_match_floor` | 0.92 |
+| `rentee_partial_match_floor` | 0.85 |
+| `rentee_match_min_base_score` | 0.45 |
+
+Scoring formula details (recurrence accumulator, date-pattern sub-scores): see core [`pipeline/scoring/README.md`](../../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) — **Scoring profiles → rent**.
+
+Hint grouping is **not** used for rent; see [`pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md`](../../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/hint_grouping/README.md) for contrast with gift/property-sale paths.
+
+---
+
+## Configuration
+
+### `config/rent_detector.yaml`
+
+| Section | Key fields |
+|---------|------------|
+| `weights` | Scoring component weights (table above) |
+| `thresholds` | `return_threshold`, `probable_rent`, `possible_rent` |
+| `candidate_generation` | `min_skeleton_group_size`, `graph_edge_threshold`, `dedup_txn_id_overlap_pct`, `max_candidates_to_return` (10), `max_near_misses` (10), `monthly_gap_days_min/max`, `date_tolerance_days` |
+| `rent_hints` | Default tolerance, target day, rentee match floors |
+| `amount` | `stable_pct_tolerance`, `moderate_pct_tolerance`, `outlier_mad_ratio` |
+
+### `config/rent_keywords.yaml`
+
+| Key | Purpose |
+|-----|---------|
+| `positive_keywords` | RENT, RENTAL INCOME, LANDLORD, TENANCY, … |
+| `negative_keywords` | DEPOSIT REFUND, DEPOSIT RETURN, … (zero-score adversaries) |
+
+### `config/RentConfig.py`
+
+| Method | Purpose |
+|--------|---------|
+| `config_overrides_for_core()` | Push rent tuning into `AppConfig` for skeleton/graph phases |
+| `weights()`, `thresholds()`, `candidate_generation()`, `rent_hints()` | Typed accessors |
+| `description_signals()` | Flat keyword → `DescriptionSignalConfig` |
+
