+
+## Request parsing
+
+**Module:** `RentRequestParsing.py`
+
+| Function | Role |
+|----------|------|
+| `rent_request_from_mapping(data)` | JSON → `BankTransactionRequest` |
+| `to_validation_payload(request)` | Payload for core validation |
+| `rent_warning_from_salary(warning)` | Core → pipeline warning DTO |
+
+Top-level `rent_hints` (and legacy alias keys via core `normalize_hint_inputs_payload`) map into `hint_inputs.rent_hints`. Default `analysis_id="rent_analysis"`.
+
+---
+
+## REST sequence diagram
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant Client
+    participant Route as RentDetectRoute
+    participant Parse as RentRequestParsing
+    participant Tool as detect_rent_candidates
+    participant Svc as RentTransactionExtractorService
+    participant Core as nw_agcore_bank_transactions
+
+    Client->>Route: POST /api/v1/rent/detect
+    Route->>Parse: rent_request_from_mapping(body)
+    Parse-->>Route: BankTransactionRequest
+    Route->>Tool: detect_rent_candidates(payload, ctx...)
+    Tool->>Svc: detect(payload)
+    Svc->>Core: validation → features → skeleton/graph
+    Svc->>Svc: _recover_distinct_rent_streams
+    Svc->>Core: run_score_recurrence_pool(profile=rent)
+    Svc->>Core: ranking
+    Svc-->>Tool: BankTransactionResult
+    Tool-->>Route: BankTransactionResult
+    Route-->>Client: JSON { ok, result }
+```
