+# Salary Extractor Business Agent
+
+**Package:** `nw-agbus-salary-extractor` · **Module:** `nw_agbus_salary_extractor`  
+**Role:** End-to-end UK salary detection — chains the full 12-phase bank-transaction pipeline plus employment-transition linking, negative-keyword filtering, and ranking.
+
+Phase algorithms live in [`nw-agcore-bank-transactions`](../../core/bank-transactions/) — not duplicated here.
+
+**Package reference:** [`src/nw_agbus_salary_extractor/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_salary_extractor/README.md) · **Orchestration:** [`src/nw_agbus_salary_extractor/services/README.md`](src/nw_agbus_salary_extractor/services/README.md)
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [High-level design (HLD)](#high-level-design-hld)
+- [Low-level design (LLD)](#low-level-design-lld)
+- [Pipeline orchestration](#pipeline-orchestration)
+- [Setup and run](#setup-and-run)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+- [Related components](#related-components)
+- [Further reading](#further-reading)
