+## Low-level design (LLD)
+
+### Agent layout
+
+```
+agents/business/salary-extractor/
+├── config/deployment.yaml, env.*
+├── src/nw_agbus_salary_extractor/
+│   ├── app/           Bootstrap.py, Main.py
+│   ├── channels/      Registry.py, rest/, tools/, grpc/
+│   ├── core/          Agent.py, Orchestrator.py
+│   └── services/      SalaryTransactionExtractorService.py, config/
+└── tests/unit/, feature/scenarios/   # 84 YAML scenarios
+```
+
+PascalCase modules throughout (`Bootstrap.py`, `SalaryDetectRoute.py`, …).
+
+### Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `app.Bootstrap` | `load_settings` + manifest + `register_channels` |
+| `app.Main` | Typer `run --env dev\|qa\|uat\|prod` → uvicorn |
+| `channels.Registry` | REST router + tools package + optional gRPC |
+| `channels.rest.SalaryDetectRoute` | `POST /api/v1/salary/detect` |
+| `channels.rest.RestRegistry` / `Router` | FastAPI router assembly |
+| `channels.tools.SalaryTransactionExtractorTools` | `@tool detect_salary_candidates` |
+| `channels.grpc.Servicer` / `Converters` / `GrpcRegistry` | gRPC detect (disabled by default) |
+| `core.Orchestrator` | Thin in-process `detect()` facade |
+| `core.Agent` | `BusinessAgent` stub |
+| `services.SalaryTransactionExtractorService` | 14-step pipeline orchestrator |
+| `services.SalaryRequestParsing` | JSON/proto → `BankTransactionRequest` |
+| `services.config.SalaryConfig` | YAML overrides → `AppConfig` |
+
+### Runtime bootstrap sequence
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant CLI as Main.py
+    participant BS as Bootstrap.build_runtime
+    participant M as deployment.yaml
+    participant R as register_channels
+    participant AB as AgentChannelBootstrap
+
+    CLI->>BS: component_root, NW_ENV
+    BS->>M: load manifest
+    BS->>R: ChannelRegistry
+    BS->>AB: build(manifest, registry)
+    AB-->>CLI: AgentChannelRuntime
+    CLI->>CLI: uvicorn if REST enabled
+```
+
+### Per-request REST flow
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant C as Client
+    participant RT as SalaryDetectRoute
+    participant T as detect_salary_candidates
+    participant SVC as SalaryTransactionExtractorService
+
+    C->>RT: POST /api/v1/salary/detect
+    RT->>T: BankTransactionRequest + RouteContext
+    T->>SVC: detect(payload)
+    SVC-->>C: BankTransactionResult JSON
+```
+
