+
+## Pipeline orchestration
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[BankTransactionRequest] --> V[1 validation]
+    V -->|early_exit| OUT0[warnings only]
+    V --> N[2 normalization]
+    N --> F[3 features]
+    F --> H[4 salary hints]
+    H --> S[5 skeleton]
+    H --> G[6 graph_clustering]
+    S --> D[7 dedup]
+    G --> D
+    D --> B[8 bonus_expense_split]
+    B --> A[9 amount_date_fallback]
+    A --> SC[10 scoring]
+    SC --> ET[11 employment_transition]
+    ET --> NK[negative_keywords]
+    NK --> R[12 ranking]
+    R --> OUT[BankTransactionResult]
+```
+
+Agent additions: `SalaryConfig` overrides, `negative_keywords.yaml` partition, optional audit snapshot.
+
+| Doc | What it covers |
+|-----|----------------|
+| [Core pipeline phases](../../core/bank-transactions/README.md#pipeline-phases) | Phase algorithms (do not duplicate here) |
+| [Core scoring](../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md) | Weights, bands, composite formula |
+| [services/README.md](src/nw_agbus_salary_extractor/services/README.md) | Step-by-step orchestration |
