+## Setup and run
+
+**Prerequisites:** Python ≥ 3.12, [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), `uv sync --all-packages` from repo root.
+
+| File | Dev settings |
+|------|-------------|
+| `config/env.dev` | `HOST=127.0.0.1`, `PORT=8020`, `GRPC_PORT=5020`, `LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG` |
+
+```bash
+pnpm dev:salary-extractor:rest
+# or:
+uv run --package nw-agbus-salary-extractor python -m nw_agbus_salary_extractor.app.Main --env dev
+```
+
+OpenAPI: `http://127.0.0.1:8020/docs`
+
+```bash
+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8020/api/v1/salary/detect \
+  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
+  -d '{"analysis_id":"demo","transactions":[{"id":"t1","date":"2024-01-25","description":"ACME SALARY","credit_amount":"2500.00","debit_amount":0}]}' | jq .
+```
