+## Confidence scoring overview
+
+| Stage | Behaviour |
+|-------|-----------|
+| Phases 3–9 | Interim scores from skeleton/graph/fallback (see core package README) |
+| **Scoring (phase 10)** | Canonical `final_score` via `run_score_candidate_pool` + salary `AppConfig` weights |
+| Employment transition | `min(cand_a, cand_b)` on linked pairs |
+| Ranking | Threshold filter only; no rescoring |
+
+Bands and composite formula: [`../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md`](../../../core/bank-transactions/src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring/README.md).
