+
+## Request parsing
+
+**Module:** `SalaryRequestParsing.py`
+
+| Function | Role |
+|----------|------|
+| `salary_request_from_mapping(data)` | JSON dict → `BankTransactionRequest` (REST entry) |
+| `to_validation_payload(request)` | Strip transport-only fields before core validation |
+| `salary_warning_from_core(warning)` | Map `nw_core.validation.ValidationWarning` → pipeline DTO |
+| `_raw_transaction_from_mapping(row)` | Single transaction row normalisation |
+
+### Field mapping
+
+- `transactions[]` → `RawBankTransaction` tuple (id, date, description, debit/credit amounts, optional balance/reference/page/line)
+- Top-level hint keys (`salary_hints`, `employer_hints`, …) → `HintInputs` via core `hint_inputs_from_mapping(normalize_hint_inputs_payload(data))`
+- `transactions_range.start` / `.from` and `.end` / `.to` accepted
+- Defaults: `analysis_id="salary_analysis"`, `jurisdiction="GB"`, `validation_mode="lenient"`
+
+gRPC converters call the same parsing path after proto → struct conversion.
+
