+
+## REST sequence diagram
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant Client
+    participant Route as SalaryDetectRoute
+    participant Helpers as RouteHelpers
+    participant Parse as SalaryRequestParsing
+    participant Tool as detect_salary_candidates
+    participant Svc as SalaryTransactionExtractorService
+    participant Core as nw_agcore_bank_transactions
+
+    Client->>Route: POST /api/v1/salary/detect
+    Route->>Helpers: build_context(body)
+    Helpers-->>Route: RouteContext (config, calendar)
+    Route->>Parse: salary_request_from_mapping(body)
+    Parse-->>Route: BankTransactionRequest
+    Route->>Tool: detect_salary_candidates(payload, ctx...)
+    Tool->>Svc: detect(payload, ...)
+    loop 14 pipeline phases
+        Svc->>Core: run_* phase tools
+        Core-->>Svc: phase result
+    end
+    Svc-->>Tool: BankTransactionResult
+    Tool-->>Route: BankTransactionResult
+    Route->>Helpers: success_response(result)
+    Helpers-->>Client: JSON { ok, result }
+```
+
+On exception, `error_response(exc, tool_name="detect_salary_candidates")` returns a structured tool error.
