+# Bank Transactions Core Agent
+
+**Package:** `nw-agcore-bank-transactions`  
+**Module:** `nw_agcore_bank_transactions`  
+**Role:** Standalone deployable that exposes the salary-detection **bank-transaction pipeline** as composable, stateless phase tools — via **REST** and the **tools channel**.
+
+This agent does **not** run an end-to-end orchestrator. Each pipeline phase is independently callable. Full salary detection is orchestrated by the business agent [`salary-extractor`](../../business/salary-extractor/) (`SalaryTransactionExtractorService.detect`), which imports and chains the `run_*` functions from this package.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [High-level design (HLD)](#high-level-design-hld)
+  - [Purpose](#purpose)
+  - [System context](#system-context)
