+## Low-level design (LLD)
+
+### Package layout
+
+```
+agents/core/bank-transactions/
+├── config/
+│   ├── deployment.yaml      # channel toggles
+│   └── env.{dev,qa,uat,prod}
+├── src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/
+│   ├── app/
+│   │   ├── Bootstrap.py     # manifest + channel assembly
+│   │   └── Main.py          # Typer CLI → uvicorn
+│   ├── channels/
+│   │   ├── Registry.py      # thin wrapper → build_agent_channel_registry
+│   │   ├── tools/           # all @tool definitions (per phase)
+│   │   ├── rest/            # Router, BaseToolRoute, phase routes
+│   │   ├── grpc/            # stub (disabled)
+│   │   └── mq/              # stub (disabled)
+│   ├── core/
+│   │   └── Agent.py         # stub BaseAgent (optional embed contract; not a channel)
+│   └── pipeline/
+│       ├── _models/         # shared domain types
+│       ├── _services/       # shared recurrence helpers
+│       ├── calendar/        # UK calendar YAML (bundled in wheel)
+│       ├── validation/ … ranking/   # 11 phase directories (Service + models only)
+│       └── applications/salary_extractor/  # shared DTOs only
+└── tests/
+    ├── unit/                # phase-focused tests (~436)
+    └── feature/             # channel bootstrap smoke
+```
+
+### Phase module pattern (LLD)
+
+Every active pipeline phase follows the same structure:
+
+| Layer | File pattern | Responsibility |
+|-------|--------------|----------------|
+| **Tool** | `channels/tools/<phase>/*Tools.py` | `@tool`-decorated `run_*` entry point; logging, audit hooks, schema guard |
+| **Service** | `pipeline/<phase>/*Service.py` | Deterministic business logic |
+| **Models** | `pipeline/<phase>/models/` | Phase input/output DTOs |
+| **Config** | `pipeline/<phase>/config/*.yaml` | Thresholds, keywords, weights (merged via `load_config()`) |
+| **REST** | `channels/rest/routes/*Route.py` | Thin FastAPI adapter → calls `run_*` with `RouteContext` |
+
+Tool discovery: [`channels/Registry.py`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/channels/Registry.py) uses `build_agent_channel_registry(tools_package="nw_agcore_bank_transactions.channels.tools")` to register all `*Tools.py` modules. Each `pipeline/<phase>/__init__.py` re-exports `run_*` for stable imports by business agents.
+
+REST wiring: [`channels/rest/Router.py`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/channels/rest/Router.py) mounts [`all_core_tool_routes()`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/channels/rest/routes/__init__.py) under prefix `/api/v1`.
+
+### Runtime bootstrap sequence
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant CLI as Main.py CLI
+    participant BS as Bootstrap.build_runtime
+    participant M as AgentDeploymentManifest
+    participant R as register_channels
+    participant AB as AgentChannelBootstrap
+
+    CLI->>BS: component_root, NW_ENV
+    BS->>BS: load_settings(BaseComponentSettings)
+    BS->>M: load deployment.yaml
+    BS->>R: ChannelRegistry
+    R-->>BS: RestChannelModule + ToolsChannelModule
+    BS->>AB: build(manifest, registry)
+    AB-->>CLI: AgentChannelRuntime (app + tool_registry)
+    CLI->>CLI: uvicorn.run(app) if REST enabled
+```
+
+### Per-request REST flow
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant C as Client
+    participant RT as *Route
+    participant CTX as RouteContext.from_request
+    participant T as run_* tool
+
+    C->>RT: POST /api/v1/...
+    RT->>CTX: load_config + WorkingDayCalendar + region
+    RT->>T: phase inputs + audit/warnings refs
+    T-->>RT: phase result DTO
+    RT-->>C: JSON response
+```
+
+`RouteContext` ([`channels/rest/RouteContext.py`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/channels/rest/RouteContext.py)) creates a **fresh** `AppConfig` and `WorkingDayCalendar` per HTTP request so concurrent calls do not share holiday caches.
+
