+
+## Pipeline phases
+
+| # | Directory | Audit phase | Tool function | REST path |
+|---|-----------|-------------|---------------|-----------|
+| 1 | `validation/` | `validate` | `run_validate_bank_transaction_payload` | `POST /api/v1/validation/validate` |
+| 2 | `normalization/` | `normalise` | `run_normalize_bank_transactions` | `POST /api/v1/normalization/normalize` |
+| 3 | `feature_extraction/` | `features` | `run_extract_bank_transaction_features` | `POST /api/v1/features/extract` |
+| 4 | `hints/` | `hints` | `run_apply_bank_transaction_hints` | `POST /api/v1/hints/apply` |
+| 5 | `skeleton_grouping/` | `skeleton` | `run_emit_skeleton_candidates` | `POST /api/v1/skeleton/emit` |
+| 6 | `graph_clustering/` | `graph_clustering` | `run_graph_clustering` | `POST /api/v1/clustering/graph` |
+| 7 | `graph_clustering/` | `graph_clustering` | `run_dedup_candidate_pool` | `POST /api/v1/clustering/dedup` |
+| 8 | `bonus_expense_split/` | `bonus_expense_split` | `run_bonus_expense_split` | `POST /api/v1/scoring/bonus-expense-split` |
+| 9 | `amount_date_fallback/` | `amount_date_fallback` | `run_amount_date_fallback` | `POST /api/v1/scoring/amount-date-fallback` |
+| 10 | `scoring/` | `score` | `run_score_candidate_pool` | `POST /api/v1/scoring/score` |
+| 11 | `employment_transition/` | `employment_transition` | `run_link_employment_transitions` | `POST /api/v1/scoring/employment-transition` |
+| 12 | `ranking/` | `ranking` | `run_rank_candidates` | `POST /api/v1/ranking/rank` |
+
+**Supporting packages (no standalone tool):**
+
+| Path | Role |
+|------|------|
+| `pipeline/_models/` | `BankTransaction`, `SalaryCandidateSet`, feature/candidate types |
+| `pipeline/_services/recurrence/` | Shared recurrence fitting for scoring, skeleton, fallback |
+| `pipeline/calendar/config/` | UK working-day defaults + bank-holiday overrides (loaded by `ConfigLoader`) |
+| `pipeline/applications/salary_extractor/` | Shared request/result models (`SalaryBankTransactionRequest`, etc.) |
+
+Per-phase READMEs with design, business logic, confidence scoring, and diagrams: [`src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/*/README.md`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/README.md#pipeline-phases). Shared model and recurrence docs: [`_models/README.md`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/_models/README.md), [`_services/recurrence/README.md`](src/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/_services/recurrence/README.md).
