+## Setup and run
+
+### Prerequisites
+
+- Python ≥ 3.12, [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)
+- From repo root: `uv sync --all-packages`
+
+### Environment
+
+| File | Key settings |
+|------|--------------|
+| `config/env.dev` | `HOST=127.0.0.1`, `PORT=8010`, `LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG` |
+| `config/env.qa` / `env.uat` | `PORT=8099`, `LOG_LEVEL=INFO` |
+| `config/env.prod` | `PORT=8099`, `LOG_LEVEL=WARNING` |
+
+Set `NW_ENV=dev|qa|uat|prod` (default `dev`). Settings load from `config/env.{NW_ENV}` via `nw_core.config.ComponentSettings`.
+
+### Start the agent (REST + tools)
+
+From repo root:
+
+```bash
+pnpm dev:bank-transactions:rest
+# equivalent:
+uv run --package nw-agcore-bank-transactions nw-agcore-bank-transactions run --env dev
+```
+
+**Expected startup:**
+
+```
+Starting REST on 127.0.0.1:8010
+```
+
+OpenAPI docs: `http://127.0.0.1:8010/docs`
+
+### Tools-only mode
+
+Set `channels.rest.enabled: false` and `channels.tools.enabled: true` in `deployment.yaml`. The CLI prints registered tool schemas instead of starting uvicorn.
+
+### Quick REST smoke test
+
+```bash
+curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8010/api/v1/validation/validate \
+  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
+  -d '{"payload":{"analysis_id":"demo","transactions":[]},"mode":"lenient"}' | jq .
+```
+
+Expect HTTP 200 with a validation result (empty transactions may produce warnings depending on mode).
+
