+## Configuration
+
+### Deployment manifest
+
+[`config/deployment.yaml`](config/deployment.yaml):
+
+```yaml
+unit: nw-agcore-bank-transactions
+mode: standalone
+channels:
+  rest:   { enabled: true,  prefix: "" }
+  tools:  { enabled: true }
+  grpc:   { enabled: false }
+  mq:     { enabled: false }
+```
+
+### Pipeline YAML (merged at runtime)
+
+Loaded by `nw_aglib_toolkit.pipeline.config.load_config()`:
+
+| Config path | Purpose |
+|-------------|---------|
+| `pipeline/normalization/config/normalization_config.yaml` | Text normalisation rules |
+| `pipeline/feature_extraction/config/*.yaml` | Keywords, payment codes, bank overrides |
+| `pipeline/hints/config/*.yaml` | Hint thresholds, processing toggles |
+| `pipeline/scoring/config/*.yaml` | Weights, amount regimes, candidate caps |
+| `pipeline/calendar/config/calendar_config.yaml` | UK calendar tolerances |
+| `pipeline/calendar/config/uk_bank_holidays.yaml` | Holiday override layer |
+| `nw_aglib_toolkit/pipeline/config/versions.yaml` | Config version metadata |
+
+Overrides can be passed per REST request via route body fields (see individual OpenAPI specs under `channels/rest/routes/openapi/`).
