+### Run commands
+
+From this directory (`agents/core/bank-transactions/`):
+
+```bash
+# All tests
+uv run pytest
+
+# Unit tests (mirrors src layout)
+uv run pytest tests/unit -q
+
+# Feature tests — one REST test per pipeline stage
+uv run pytest tests/feature -m feature -q
+
+# Single phase unit tests
+uv run pytest tests/unit/nw_agcore_bank_transactions/pipeline/scoring -q
+
+# Coverage report (HTML → htmlcov/)
+./scripts/test_with_coverage.sh
+# or:
+uv sync --group dev
+uv run pytest --cov=nw_agcore_bank_transactions --cov-report=term-missing --cov-report=html:htmlcov
