+# nw_agcore_bank_transactions
+
+**Package:** `nw-agcore-bank-transactions`  
+**Module:** `nw_agcore_bank_transactions`  
+**Role:** Core bank-transaction pipeline — stateless phase tools for validation through ranking, exposed via REST and the tools channel.
+
+Full end-to-end salary detection is orchestrated by [`salary-extractor`](../../../../business/salary-extractor/) (`SalaryTransactionExtractorService.detect`), which chains `run_*` functions from this package.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Architecture](#architecture)
+- [Module index](#module-index)
+- [Pipeline orchestration](#pipeline-orchestration)
+- [Confidence scoring overview](#confidence-scoring-overview)
+- [Quick start](#quick-start)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Package layout](#package-layout)
+- [Pipeline phases](#pipeline-phases)
+- [Shared packages](#shared-packages)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+
+---
+
+## Architecture
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph pkg [nw_agcore_bank_transactions]
+        App[app Bootstrap Main]
+        Channels[channels Registry tools rest]
+        Pipeline[pipeline phases]
+        Core[core Agent]
+    end
+
+    subgraph consumers [Consumers]
+        SalaryExt[salary-extractor]
+        BizExt[rent gift property-sale extractors]
+        REST[REST clients]
+        Tools[LLM tool callers]
+    end
+
+    subgraph libs [Libraries]
+        Toolkit[nw-aglib-toolkit]
+        NwCore[nw-core]
+    end
+
+    SalaryExt -->|run_* chain| Pipeline
+    BizExt -->|hints scoring profiles| Pipeline
+    REST --> Channels
+    Tools --> Channels
+    Channels --> Pipeline
+    App --> Channels
+    pkg --> Toolkit
+    Toolkit --> NwCore
+```
+
+---
+
+## Module index
+
+### Application and channels
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `app.Bootstrap` | Load manifest, assemble channel registry |
+| `app.Main` | Typer CLI → uvicorn |
+| `channels.Registry` | `build_agent_channel_registry` wrapper |
+| `channels.tools.*Tools` | `@tool` entry points per phase |
+| `channels.rest.Router` | FastAPI router mounting `/api/v1/...` |
+| `channels.rest.RouteContext` | Per-request config + calendar |
+| `core.Agent` | Optional `BaseAgent` stub (not a network channel) |
+
+### Pipeline phases
+
+| # | Package | Service | Tool |
+|---|---------|---------|------|
+| 1 | `pipeline.validation` | `BankTransactionValidationService` | `run_validate_bank_transaction_payload` |
+| 2 | `pipeline.normalization` | `BankTransactionNormalizationService` | `run_normalize_bank_transactions` |
+| 3 | `pipeline.feature_extraction` | `BankTransactionFeatureExtractionService` | `run_extract_bank_transaction_features` |
+| 4 | `pipeline.hints` | `BankTransactionHintService` | `run_apply_bank_transaction_hints` |
+| 5 | `pipeline.skeleton_grouping` | `SkeletonGroupingService` | `run_emit_skeleton_candidates` |
+| 6–7 | `pipeline.graph_clustering` | `GraphClusteringService`, dedup | `run_graph_clustering`, `run_dedup_candidate_pool` |
+| 8 | `pipeline.bonus_expense_split` | `BonusExpenseSplitService` | `run_bonus_expense_split` |
+| 9 | `pipeline.amount_date_fallback` | `AmountDateFallbackService` | `run_amount_date_fallback` |
+| 10 | `pipeline.scoring` | `ScoringService` | `run_score_candidate_pool` (+ hint/recurrence variants) |
+| 11 | `pipeline.employment_transition` | `EmploymentTransitionService` | `run_link_employment_transitions` |
+| 12 | `pipeline.ranking` | `RankingService` | `run_rank_candidates` |
+| — | `pipeline.hint_grouping` | `HintAmountGroupingService` | `run_generate_hint_candidates` (gift/property-sale) |
+
+Source files use Java-style PascalCase (`ScoringService.py`, `GiftMatcher.py`, …).
+
+---
+
+## Pipeline orchestration
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[BankTransactionRequest] --> V[1 validation]
+    V -->|early_exit| OUT0[Empty result]
+    V --> N[2 normalization]
+    N --> F[3 feature_extraction]
+    F --> H[4 hints]
+    H --> S[5 skeleton_grouping]
+    H --> G[6 graph_clustering]
+    S --> D[7 dedup_candidate_pool]
+    G --> D
+    D --> B[8 bonus_expense_split]
+    B --> A[9 amount_date_fallback]
+    A --> SC[10 scoring]
+    SC --> ET[11 employment_transition]
+    ET --> R[12 ranking]
+    R --> OUT[returned + near_miss candidates]
+```
+
+Phases 5 and 6 run in parallel on hinted credits; phase 7 merges by transaction-id overlap.
+
+---
+
+## Confidence scoring overview
+
+| Phase | Where confidence is set | Notes |
+|-------|-------------------------|-------|
+| feature_extraction | `TransactionFeatures.payment_channel_confidence` | Per transaction; feeds scoring channel score |
+| skeleton_grouping | `PlausibilityScore.final` | Interim; anchor floor ≥ 0.55 |
+| graph_clustering | `0.50 + 0.25×size + 0.15 if anchor` | Interim; rescored in phase 10 |
+| amount_date_fallback | `min(0.55, 0.40 + 0.10×fit + anchor bump)` | Hard cap by design |
+| **scoring** | `ScoreBreakdown.final_score` → `confidence` | **Canonical**; `ConfidenceDetail` audit trail |
+| employment_transition | `min(cand_a, cand_b)` on merge | Adjustment only |
+| ranking | Threshold filter | No rescoring |
+
+Bands (`very_high` 0.92, `high` 0.85, `medium_high` 0.70, `medium` 0.55, `low` 0.40) are applied in scoring via `confidence_band()`.
+
+See [`pipeline/scoring/README.md`](pipeline/scoring/README.md) for the composite formula and accumulator stages.
