+        config: Application configuration for employment-transition rules.
+        audit: Optional audit builder for per-phase trace capture.
+        warnings: Optional list extended with transition warnings.
+
+    Returns:
+        EmploymentTransitionToolResult with transition-linked candidates.
+    """
+    return _default_tool.run(
+        scored,
+        audit=audit,
+        warnings=warnings,
+        config=config,
+    )
