+# Domain Models (`pipeline/_models`)
+
+Shared **frozen dataclasses** for the bank-transaction salary pipeline and cross-detector APIs.
+These types flow from validation through normalization, feature extraction, candidate generation,
+scoring, employment linking, and ranking. Wire JSON uses plain dicts for nested breakdown fields;
+`ModelDict.to_model_dict` normalises dataclass fragments on `CandidateSet` construction.
+
+## Table of contents
+
+- [Model layers](#model-layers)
+- [Transaction models](#transaction-models)
+- [Feature models](#feature-models)
+- [Candidate models](#candidate-models)
+- [Scoring models](#scoring-models)
+- [Request and result envelopes](#request-and-result-envelopes)
+- [Constants](#constants)
+- [Type relationships](#type-relationships)
+- [Key source files](#key-source-files)
+- [Tests](#tests)
+
+## Model layers
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph input [Input layer]
+        RAW[RawBankTransaction]
+        REQ[BankTransactionRequest]
+    end
+    subgraph processing [Processing layer]
+        BT[BankTransaction]
+        TF[TransactionFeatures]
+    end
+    subgraph output [Output layer]
+        CT[CandidateTransaction]
+        CS[CandidateSet]
+        CD[ConfidenceDetail]
+        SB[ScoreBreakdown]
+        DP[DetectedPattern]
+        GPC[GapPeriodCandidate]
+    end
+    subgraph envelope [Result envelope]
+        BTR[BankTransactionResult]
+    end
+    RAW --> BT
+    BT --> TF
+    BT --> CT
+    CT --> CS
+    CD --> CS
+    SB --> CS
+    CS --> BTR
+```
+
+## Transaction models
+
+### `RawBankTransaction`
+
+Caller-supplied row — Design §4.1.
+
+| Field | Type | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `id` | `str` | Stable transaction identifier |
+| `date` | `str` | ISO date string |
+| `description` | `str` | Raw statement text |
+| `debit_amount` / `credit_amount` | `Amount` | Loose numeric types; normalised to `Decimal` |
+| `balance` | optional | Statement balance |
+| `reference`, `page`, `line` | optional | Provenance |
+| `is_brought_forward`, `is_final_balance` | `bool` | Balance marker rows |
+
+Properties: `is_credit`, `is_debit`, `is_balance_marker`. Salary pipeline consumes **credit**
+rows only.
+
+**File:** `RawBankTransaction.py`
+
+### `BankTransaction`
+
+Enhanced normalised view — Design §4.2.
+
+| Field | Type | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `raw` | `RawBankTransaction` | Immutable source row |
+| `normalised_description` | `str` | Phase 2 cleanup output |
+| `description_tokens` | `tuple[str, …]` | Tokenised description |
+| `skeleton` | `str` | Skeleton key for grouping |
+| `metadata` | `BankTransactionMetadata` | Optional pipeline metadata |
+| `features` | `TransactionFeatures \| None` | Optional embedded features |
+
+Properties: `id`, `date` (`date` object), `amount` (`Decimal` credit), `raw_description`.
+
+**File:** `BankTransaction.py`
+
+### `BankTransactionMetadata`
+
+Extensible metadata bag attached to `BankTransaction`.
+
+**File:** `BankTransactionMetadata.py`
+
+## Feature models
+
+### `TransactionFeatures`
+
+Per-transaction features from phase 3 — Design §4.3.
+
+| Field | Type | Purpose |
+|---|---|---|
+| `transaction_id` | `str` | Join key |
+| `payment_channel` | `str` | e.g. `bacs_or_direct_credit`, `faster_payment` |
+| `payment_channel_confidence` | `float` | Channel classifier confidence |
+| `payment_channel_matched_tokens` | `tuple[str, …]` | Evidence tokens |
+| `salary_hint_tokens` | `tuple[str, …]` | PAYROLL, SALARY, … |
+| `negative_tokens` | `tuple[str, …]` | Pension, DWP, refund markers |
+| `possible_employer_tokens` | `tuple[str, …]` | Extracted employer-like tokens |
+| `day_of_month`, `weekday` | `int` | Calendar features |
+| `is_month_end`, `is_last_working_day`, `is_first_working_day` | `bool` | Payday hints |
+| `is_bank_holiday_adjacent` | `bool` | UK calendar adjustment |
+| `is_anchor`, `anchor_hint_id`, `ambiguous_anchor` | | Payslip anchor flags |
+
+Used by scoring sub-scores, hint applicators, and negative-keyword rejection.
+
+**File:** `TransactionFeatures.py`
+
+## Candidate models
+
+### `CandidateTransaction`
+
+One transaction inside a candidate set.
+
+| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `date` | `str` | | ISO date |
+| `description` | `str` | | Display description |
+| `amount` | `float` | | Credit amount |
+| `transaction_id` | `str` | UUID | Links to `BankTransaction.id` |
+| `confidence` | `float` | 0.0 | Often mirrors set-level score |
+| `confidence_band` | `str` | `very_low` | Band label |
+| `reasoning` | `tuple[str, …]` | | Per-txn narrative (optional) |
+| `confidence_details` | `tuple[ConfidenceDetail, …]` | | Merged audit steps |
+
+Factory: `candidate_transaction_from(BankTransaction, …)`.
+
+**File:** `CandidateTransaction.py`
+
+### `CandidateSet`
+
+Unified ranked candidate for **all** detectors (salary, rent, gift, property sale).
+
+| Field | Type | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `candidate_set_id` | `str` | Stable id from generation phase |
+| `candidate_type` | `str` | See `CANDIDATE_TYPES` (+ business types) |
+| `transactions` | `tuple[CandidateTransaction, …]` | Member credits |
+| `score_breakdown` | `dict[str, Any]` | Sub-scores; accepts `ScoreBreakdown` dataclass |
+| `detected_pattern` | `dict[str, Any]` | Frequency, payday model, amount model, … |
+| `reasoning` | `tuple[str, …]` | Positive evidence sentences |
+| `risks` | `tuple[str, …]` | Caveats for reviewers |
+| `confidence` | `float` | Canonical score (0–1) |
+| `confidence_band` | `str` | Must ∈ `CONFIDENCE_BANDS` |
+| `confidence_details` | `tuple[ConfidenceDetail, …]` | Step audit from scoring |
+| `gap_period_candidates` | `tuple[GapPeriodCandidate, …]` | Missing-month plausibles |
+| `missing_months` | `tuple[str, …]` | `"YYYY-MM"` labels |
+| `metadata` | `dict[str, Any]` | Source tags, gap summary, match levels, … |
+
+**Type aliases** (same class): `SalaryCandidateSet`, `RentCandidateSet`, `GiftCandidateSet`,
+`PropertySaleCandidateSet`.
+
+Validation: `confidence_band` must be one of `CONFIDENCE_BANDS` or `ValueError` is raised.
+`score_breakdown` / `detected_pattern` coerced via `to_model_dict`.
+
+**File:** `CandidateSet.py`
+
+### `GapPeriodCandidate`
+
+Plausible credits for a salary period with no confirmed match.
+
+| Field | Type |
+|---|---|
+| `period` | `str` — `"YYYY-MM"` |
+| `plausible_transactions` | `tuple[CandidateTransaction, …]` |
+
+Built by `ScoringPostProcess.apply_gap_periods` from orphan credits.
+
+**File:** `GapPeriodCandidate.py`
+
+### `DetectedPattern`
+
+Typed pattern metadata (often embedded in `CandidateSet.detected_pattern` dict).
+
+| Field | Default |
+|---|---|
+| `frequency` | `unknown` |
+| `payday_model` | `unknown` |
+| `payment_channel` | `unknown_credit` |
+| `amount_model` | `unknown` |
+| `possible_employer_tokens` | `()` |
+| `coverage` | `""` |
+
+**File:** `DetectedPattern.py`
+
+## Scoring models
+
+### `ScoreBreakdown`
+
+Structured sub-scores — Design §4.5, §11.
+
+| Field | Meaning |
+|---|---|
+| `date_pattern_score` | Recurrence fit |
+| `description_similarity_score` | Token Jaccard |
+| `amount_consistency_score` | Amount regime × band modifier |
+| `payment_channel_score` | Channel table score |
+| `coverage_score` | Matched / expected periods |
+| `context_bonus` | Employer + hint alignment |
+| `negative_signal_penalty` | Negative (≤ 0) |
+| `anchor_bonus` | Payslip anchor bump |
+| `employer_hint_bonus` | Name hint bump |
+| `salary_band_modifier` | FR-017 band multiplier |
+| `final_score` | Clamped composite |
+
+**File:** `ScoreBreakdown.py`
+
+### `ConfidenceDetail`
+
+One scoring step contribution — audit trail / TRACE.
+
+| Field | Type | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `step` | `str` | Stage name, e.g. `date_pattern` |
+| `confidence_step` | `float` | Signed delta applied |
+| `confidence_step_max_value` | `float` | Max magnitude for this component |
+| `reasoning` | `str` | Human-readable explanation |
+| `data` | `Mapping[str, Any]` | Structured evidence |
+
+Produced by `ConfidenceAccumulator` in `scoring/ConfidenceAccumulator.py`.
+
+**File:** `ConfidenceDetail.py`
+
+## Request and result envelopes
+
+### `BankTransactionRequest`
+
+Top-level detector request (transactions, hints, options).
+
+**File:** `requests/BankTransactionRequest.py`
+
+### `TransactionsRange`
+
+Optional caller-supplied date range for gap-summary denominator override.
+
+**File:** `requests/TransactionsRange.py`
+
+### `BankTransactionResult`
+
+Generic detector output envelope.
+
+| Field | Purpose |
+|---|---|
+| `analysis_id`, `jurisdiction`, `country_region` | Run identity |
+| `input_summary` | Counts / stats |
+| `candidate_sets` | Returned candidates |
+| `rejected_or_near_miss_sets` | Below threshold / capped |
+| `warnings` | `ValidationWarning` tuple |
+| `applied_hints` | Hint application record |
+| `inferred_country_regions` | UK calendar region inference |
+| `metadata` | Effective thresholds, caps |
+| `audit` | Optional full audit record |
+
+**File:** `results/BankTransactionResult.py`
+
+Supporting result types: `InputSummary.py`, `ResultMetadata.py`, `ValidationWarning.py`.
+
+## Constants
+
+### `CANDIDATE_TYPES`
+
+Salary/rent types validated in core pipeline:
+
+```
+probable_salary, possible_salary, recurring_income_not_salary_candidate,
+bonus_or_extra_pay_candidate, expense_reimbursement_candidate, final_pay_candidate,
+unknown_recurring_credit, probable_rent, possible_rent, recurring_income_not_rent
+```
+
+Business detectors add: `probable_gift`, `possible_gift`, `large_credit_not_gift`,
+`probable_property_sale`, `possible_property_sale`, `large_credit_not_property_sale`.
+
+**File:** `CandidateTypes.py`
+
+### `CONFIDENCE_BANDS`
+
+```python
+("very_high", "high", "medium_high", "medium", "low", "very_low")
+```
+
+Band cutoffs assigned in `ScoringService.confidence_band` (see `scoring/README.md`).
+
+## Type relationships
+
+```mermaid
+erDiagram
+    RawBankTransaction ||--|| BankTransaction : raw
+    BankTransaction ||--o| TransactionFeatures : features
+    BankTransaction ||--o{ CandidateTransaction : candidate_transaction_from
+    CandidateTransaction }o--|| CandidateSet : member
+    CandidateSet ||--o{ ConfidenceDetail : confidence_details
+    CandidateSet ||--o{ GapPeriodCandidate : gap_period_candidates
+    CandidateSet }o--|| BankTransactionResult : candidate_sets
+    ScoreBreakdown ||--|| CandidateSet : score_breakdown
+```
+
+### `ModelDict.to_model_dict`
+
+Converts nested dataclass fragments to plain `dict` for JSON serialisation. Called in
+`CandidateSet.__post_init__` for `score_breakdown` and `detected_pattern`.
+
+**File:** `ModelDict.py`
