+# UK bank-holiday YAML overrides — Design §7.1.
+#
+# The detector defaults to the `holidays` PyPI library for canonical
+# Gov.UK bank-holiday data. This file is a *manual override* layer for two
+# situations:
+#
+# 1. A region/date the lib is missing or has wrong.
+# 2. A custom holiday calendar a caller wants to inject for testing.
+#
+# Region keys must match WorkingDayCalendar regions:
+#   - EnglandAndWales
+#   - Scotland
+#   - NorthernIreland
+#
