+# Hint-Amount Grouping
+
+Generates **grouped candidate proposals** for gift and property-sale detectors from hint amount,
+date window, and soft description-match constraints. This path is **parallel to the salary
+orchestrator** — it does not run inside the 12-phase salary pipeline. Output
+`HintGroupCandidate` groups are scored by `run_score_hint_groups` (gift / property_sale profiles
+in `scoring/profiles/`).
+
+## Table of contents
+
+- [Pipeline position](#pipeline-position)
+- [Entry points](#entry-points)
+- [Inputs and outputs](#inputs-and-outputs)
+- [Architecture](#architecture)
+- [Gift grouping strategy](#gift-grouping-strategy)
+- [Property sale grouping strategy](#property-sale-grouping-strategy)
+- [Confidence scoring](#confidence-scoring)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Warnings and edge cases](#warnings-and-edge-cases)
+- [Flow](#flow)
+- [Sequence diagram](#sequence-diagram)
+- [Key source files](#key-source-files)
+- [Tests](#tests)
+- [Related modules](#related-modules)
+
+## Pipeline position
+
+| Property | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Audit phase name | `hint_grouping` |
+| Salary pipeline | **Not included** — used by business agents (`gift-extractor`, `property-sale-extractor`) |
+| Upstream | Normalised credits + parsed hint inputs |
+| Downstream | `run_score_hint_groups` → ranking in business agent |
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart LR
+    TXN[Credit transactions] --> HINTS[Hint inputs parsed]
+    HINTS --> GRP[run_generate_hint_candidates]
+    GRP --> GIFT[GiftGroupingStrategy]
+    GRP --> SALE[PropertySaleGroupingStrategy]
+    GIFT --> GROUPS[HintGroupCandidate list]
+    SALE --> GROUPS
+    GROUPS --> SCORE[run_score_hint_groups]
+    SCORE --> RANK[Business agent ranking]
+```
+
+## Entry points
+
+### Tool
+
+```python
+from nw_agcore_bank_transactions.channels.tools.hint_grouping import (
+    run_generate_hint_candidates,
+)
+
+result = run_generate_hint_candidates(
+    transactions,
+    profile="gift",  # or "property_sale"
+    hint_inputs=gift_hints,
+    hint_matcher=None,  # optional GiftHintMatcher / PropertySaleHintMatcher override
+    audit=audit,
+    warnings=warnings,
+)
+groups = list(result.groups)
+```
+
+| Layer | File | Role |
+|---|---|---|
+| Tool | `HintGroupingTools.py` | Profile dispatch, `run_generate_hint_candidates` |
+| Orchestrator | `HintAmountGroupingService.py` | Strategy injection |
+| Strategies | `strategies/GiftStrategy.py`, `strategies/PropertySaleStrategy.py` | Group generation |
+| Model | `GroupCandidate.py` | `HintGroupCandidate` DTO |
+| Result | `HintGroupingModels.py` | `HintGroupingToolResult` |
+
+There is **no REST route** in the core salary agent for hint grouping; business agents expose
+detector-specific endpoints.
+
+## Inputs and outputs
+
+### Input
+
+| Field | Type | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `transactions` | `Sequence[BankTransaction]` | Credit rows to group |
+| `profile` | `"gift"` \| `"property_sale"` | Selects strategy |
+| `hint_inputs` | `GiftHints` \| `PropertySaleHints` | Amount, dates, names, flags |
+| `hint_matcher` | optional | Override default matcher behaviour |
+
+### Output: `HintGroupingToolResult`
+
+```python
+@dataclass(frozen=True)
+class HintGroupingToolResult(BaseToolModel):
+    groups: tuple[HintGroupCandidate, ...] = ()
+```
+
+### `HintGroupCandidate`
+
+| Field | Type | Purpose |
+|---|---|---|
+| `candidate_set_id` | `str` | `gift_{NNN}` or `property_sale_000` |
+| `transactions` | `tuple[BankTransaction, …]` | Cluster members |
+| `window_start` / `window_end` | `date` | Search window |
+| `aggregate_sum` | `Decimal` | Sum of member amounts |
+| `expected_date` | `date \| None` | Gift expected receipt date |
+| `reference_date` | `date \| None` | Property sale reference date |
+| `cluster_key` | `str` | Soft-match clustering key (gift) |
+| `reasoning` | `tuple[str, …]` | Human-readable grouping rationale |
+| `metadata` | `dict \| None` | Optional tags |
+
+This phase assigns **no confidence** — scoring happens in `GiftProfile` / `PropertySaleProfile`.
+
+## Architecture
+
+```mermaid
+classDiagram
+    class HintAmountGroupingService {
+        +generate_candidates(transactions, hint_inputs)
+    }
+    class HintGroupingStrategy {
+        <<Protocol>>
+        +generate_candidates()
+    }
+    class GiftGroupingStrategy
+    class PropertySaleGroupingStrategy
+    HintAmountGroupingService --> HintGroupingStrategy
+    GiftGroupingStrategy ..|> HintGroupingStrategy
+    PropertySaleGroupingStrategy ..|> HintGroupingStrategy
+```
+
+`HintGroupingTools._strategy_for_profile` maps:
+
+| Profile | Strategy | Matcher default |
+|---|---|---|
+| `gift` | `GiftGroupingStrategy` | `GiftHintMatcher` |
+| `property_sale` | `PropertySaleGroupingStrategy` | `PropertySaleHintMatcher` |
+
+## Gift grouping strategy
+
+`GiftGroupingStrategy.generate_candidates` — amount-first with optional multi-transaction
+aggregation.
+
+### Algorithm
+
+1. **Validate** — `GiftHintMatcher.validate_amount_present(hint_inputs)`; requires `amount`.
+2. **Window** — `resolve_expected_date` + `resolve_date_window` → `[window_start, window_end]`.
+3. **Eligibility**:
+   - In-window + `txn_soft_match` → eligible.
+   - Out-of-window + soft match + `meets_minimum(amount)` → eligible (late partial credits).
+   - Fallback: if no eligible but in-window txns exist, use all in-window txns.
+4. **Single-credit groups** — each eligible txn with `meets_minimum(amount)` → one group.
+5. **Multi-transaction** (when `hint_inputs.allow_multi_transaction`):
+   - Cluster in-window eligible txns by `cluster_key` (islands).
+   - For each island (and full multi set), `_best_multi_subset`:
+     - Combinations size 2…min(8, len), prefer exact aggregate = hint amount, then fewer txns.
+     - Requires `aggregate_meets_minimum(total, hint_amount)`.
+6. **Deduplicate** — prefer single-txn exact groups; drop subset-dominated groups; stable sort
+   by single-txn flag, size, aggregate sum.
+7. **Assign ids** — `gift_{idx:03d}`.
+
+### Multi-subset scoring heuristic
+
+\[
+\text{score}(\text{combo}) = (\mathbb{1}[\text{total} = \text{hint}],\; -\lvert\text{combo}\rvert)
+\]
+
+Lexicographic max selects best subset.
+
+## Property sale grouping strategy
+
+`PropertySaleGroupingStrategy.generate_candidates` — timeline window + amount range coverage.
+
+### Algorithm
+
+1. **Validate** — amount required on `PropertySaleHints`.
+2. **Window** — `resolve_reference_date` + `resolve_window` from timeline hint.
+3. **Filter** — credits in `[window_start, window_end]`; prefer `txn_soft_match`, else all
+   in-window.
+4. **Best subset** (`_best_subset`):
+   - Try per-txn amount matches → `_minimal_covering_subset` (greedy largest-first until
+     aggregate in range).
+   - Else search combinations size 1…min(8, n) maximizing `coverage = min(total, hint) / hint`.
+5. **Emit single group** — `property_sale_000` with sorted transactions and reasoning tuple.
+
+### Timeline fit (used downstream in scoring)
+
+For multi-txn groups, property sale scoring computes:
+
+\[
+\text{timeline\_fit} = \max\left(0,\; 1 - \frac{\text{span\_days}}{2 \times \text{half\_window}}\right)
+\]
+
+## Confidence scoring
+
+Grouping is **pre-score**. Canonical confidence formulas live in:
+
+| Profile | Module | Doc |
+|---|---|---|
+| Gift | `scoring/profiles/GiftProfile.py` | `scoring/README.md` § GiftProfile |
+| Property sale | `scoring/profiles/PropertySaleProfile.py` | `scoring/README.md` § PropertySaleProfile |
+
+Typical gift composite (after grouping):
+
+\[
+\text{final} = \left(\sum w_i s_i\right) \times m_{\text{overpay}}
+\]
+
+with exact-match and donor-match floors applied in the profile.
+
+## Configuration
+
+Hint grouping reads matcher behaviour from hint models and `hints/config/hint_config.yaml`
+(indirectly via matchers):
+
+| Key | Default | Used by |
+|---|---|---|
+| `default_tolerance_pct` | 0.20 | Amount range / minimum matchers |
+| `employer_bonus.*` | see yaml | Donor/buyer name overlap (scoring phase) |
+| `GiftHints.allow_multi_transaction` | hint payload | Enables multi-credit aggregation |
+| `PropertySaleHints.timeline_days` | hint payload | Window half-width |
+
+No YAML under `hint_grouping/config/` — tune via hint payloads and matcher classes.
+
+## Warnings and edge cases
+
+| Situation | Behaviour |
+|---|---|
+| Missing hint amount | `validate_amount_present` raises |
+| Empty window (property sale) | Returns `[]` |
+| No eligible gift credits | Returns `[]` (unless in-window fallback) |
+| Duplicate transaction sets | Gift dedup removes subset-dominated groups |
+| Combination explosion | Capped at subset size 8 |
+
+No `ValidationWarning` emission in this phase.
+
+## Flow
+
+### Gift path
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[transactions + GiftHints] --> VAL[validate amount]
+    VAL --> WIN[resolve expected date + window]
+    WIN --> ELIG[Build eligible set soft match + minimum]
+    ELIG --> SINGLE[Single-txn groups meeting minimum]
+    ELIG --> MULTI{allow_multi_transaction?}
+    MULTI -- yes --> ISLAND[Cluster by cluster_key]
+    ISLAND --> COMBO[_best_multi_subset combinations ≤ 8]
+    COMBO --> MERGE[Merge raw groups]
+    MULTI -- no --> MERGE
+    SINGLE --> MERGE
+    MERGE --> DEDUP[_deduplicate subset dominance]
+    DEDUP --> ID[Assign gift_NNN ids]
+    ID --> OUT[HintGroupingToolResult]
+```
+
+### Property sale path
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[transactions + PropertySaleHints] --> VAL[validate amount]
+    VAL --> REF[reference date + window]
+    REF --> FILTER[in-window credits]
+    FILTER --> SOFT[soft match or fallback all in-window]
+    SOFT --> SUBSET[_best_subset amount range search]
+    SUBSET --> EMIT[property_sale_000]
+    EMIT --> OUT[HintGroupingToolResult]
+```
+
+## Sequence diagram
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant Agent as Business agent
+    participant Tool as HintGroupingTools
+    participant Svc as HintAmountGroupingService
+    participant Strat as GiftGroupingStrategy
+    participant Score as run_score_hint_groups
+
+    Agent->>Tool: run_generate_hint_candidates(profile=gift, ...)
+    Tool->>Svc: generate_candidates(transactions, hint_inputs)
+    Svc->>Strat: generate_candidates(...)
+    Strat-->>Svc: list[HintGroupCandidate]
+    Svc-->>Tool: groups
+    Tool-->>Agent: HintGroupingToolResult
+    Agent->>Score: run_score_hint_groups(groups, profile=gift, ...)
+    Score-->>Agent: ScoringToolResult.scored
+```
