+# Bank transaction hints (Phase 4)
+
+Optional hint application on feature-enriched credit rows. Implements **Design §6.4**, **FR-016** (payslip anchors), and **FR-017** (salary band). Produces `AppliedHints` consumed by candidate generation (Phases 5–6) and scoring (Phase 10).
+
+Hints are **non-destructive**: they annotate and match; they do not filter transactions out of the pipeline.
+
+## Table of contents
+
+- [Entry point](#entry-point)
+- [Module layout](#module-layout)
+- [Business logic](#business-logic)
+- [Input / output contract](#input--output-contract)
+- [Confidence scoring](#confidence-scoring)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Logging](#logging)
+- [Flow](#flow)
+- [Tests](#tests)
+- [Related modules](#related-modules)
+- [REST endpoint](#rest-endpoint)
+
+## Entry point
+
+```python
+from nw_agcore_bank_transactions.pipeline.hints import (
+    run_apply_bank_transaction_hints,
+)
+
+result = run_apply_bank_transaction_hints(
+    credits,
+    hint_inputs,  # HintInputs | None
+    audit=audit,
+    warnings=warnings,
+)
+applied = result.applied_hints
+# result.warnings → hint_unmatched for payslip hints with no credit match
+```
+
+Post-hint enrichment (typically in orchestrator):
+
+```python
+from nw_agcore_bank_transactions.pipeline.hints import (
+    anchor_txn_ids,
+    ambiguous_anchor_ids,
+)
+from nw_agcore_bank_transactions.pipeline.hints.AnchorFlags import attach_anchor_flags
+
+ids = anchor_txn_ids(applied)
+ambig = ambiguous_anchor_ids(applied)
+enhanced = attach_anchor_flags(credits, ids, ambiguous_ids=ambig)
+```
+
+| Layer | File | Role |
+|---|---|---|
+| Public API | `channels/tools/hints/BankTransactionHintTools.py` | `run_apply_bank_transaction_hints` |
+| Service | `BankTransactionHintService.py` | Orchestrates all hint applicators |
+| Salary | `applicators/SalaryApplicator.py` | Payslip anchors, salary band |
+| Gift / Rent / Sale | `applicators/GiftApplicator.py`, `RentApplicator.py`, `PropertySaleApplicator.py` | Domain hint audit records |
+| Matchers | `matchers/GiftMatcher.py`, `RentMatcher.py`, `PropertySaleMatcher.py`, … | Reusable match primitives |
+| Parsing | `HintInputsParsing.py` | Payload normalisation, legacy key aliases |
+| Anchor | `AnchorResolution.py`, `AnchorFlags.py` | Anchor id resolution, feature flag projection |
+| Employer | `EmployerHintMatcher.py` | Employer name overlap bonus (scoring helper) |
+| Config | `config/hint_config.yaml` | Tolerances, employer bonus weights |
+| REST | `channels/rest/routes/HintsRoute.py` | Stateless FastAPI adapter |
+
+Audit phase name: `hints`.
+
+## Module layout
+
+| Module | Responsibility |
+|---|---|
+| `BankTransactionHintService.py` | `apply_hints`, employer bonus delegates |
+| `HintInputsParsing.py` | `parse_hint_inputs`, `normalize_hint_inputs_payload` |
+| `applicators/SalaryApplicator.py` | FR-016/017 core logic |
+| `AnchorFlags.py` | Sets `TransactionFeatures.is_anchor` on transactions |
+| `AnchorResolution.py` | Reads anchors from features vs `AppliedHints` |
+| `EmployerHintMatcher.py` | Token overlap for employer name hints |
+| `matchers/*Matcher.py` | Amount, date, party, keyword, timeline helpers |
+
+## Business logic
+
+### Hint input parsing (`HintInputsParsing.py`)
+
+Accepts:
+
+- Canonical wrapper: `{ "hint_inputs": { … } }`
+- Legacy root keys: `payslip_hints`, `salary_hints`, `employer_hints`, `gift_hints`, `sale_hints`, `rent_hints`, `property_sale_hints`
+
+Legacy alias: `sale_hints` → `property_sale_hints`.
+
+Builds immutable `HintInputs` with typed sub-records (`PayslipHint`, `SalaryHints`, `GiftHints`, `RentHints`, `PropertySaleHints`, `EmployerHints`).
+
+### Payslip anchors (`apply_payslip_hints`) — FR-016
+
+For each `PayslipHint`:
+
+1. Bucket credits by month key `YYYY-MM`.
+2. Find credits in hint month where **exact amount match**:
+   - `abs(txn.amount) == hint.amount` (Decimal equality)
+   - `int(abs(txn.amount)) == int(hint.amount)` (integer part match)
+3. No match → add `hint_id` to `unmatched_hint_ids`.
+4. One or more matches → create `AnchorMatch` per match; `ambiguous=True` when count &gt; 1.
+
+### Salary band (`apply_salary_band`) — FR-017
+
+When `SalaryHints` present and non-empty:
+
+```
+effective = salary_hints.effective_monthly
+tol       = salary_hints.tolerance_pct  (default from hint_config)
+lower     = effective × (1 − tol)
+upper     = effective × (1 + tol)
+```
+
+Stored on `AppliedHints`: `effective_monthly`, `band_lower`, `band_upper`.
+
+Used downstream by skeleton grouping (amount plausibility modifier) and scoring.
+
+### Gift hints (`apply_gift_hints`)
+
+Aggregate audit over transaction cluster (or full credit list):
+
+| Signal | Logic |
+|---|---|
+| Amount | `aggregate_meets_minimum(total, hint.amount)` |
+| Exact | Single txn exact amount or aggregate exact |
+| Donor | Max `donor_match_level` via `GiftHintMatcher` + `EmployerHintMatcher.overlap_match_level` |
+| Date | `cluster_min_date_delta` vs `expected_date` within tolerance |
+
+Unmatched fields recorded in `unmatched_hint_fields`.
+
+### Rent hints (`apply_rent_hints`)
+
+Per-property matching via `RentHintMatcher.match_property`:
+
+- Amount within `tolerance_pct` of property amount
+- Rentee name overlap
+- Property ref / location / postcode token match
+
+### Property sale hints (`apply_property_sale_hints`)
+
+Via `PropertySaleHintMatcher`:
+
+- Amount in range (`AmountRangeMatcher`)
+- Buyer/solicitor name overlap
+- Sale keywords (`KeywordsMatcher`)
+- Timeline window (`TimelineMatcher` + `symmetric_window`)
+
+### Employer helpers (scoring phase, exposed on service)
+
+`employer_hint_bonus` and `employer_match_level` delegate to `EmployerHintMatcher`:
+
+```
+hint_tokens     = tokenise_employer_name(hint_name)  # normalised, stop-filtered
+exact_hits      = |hint_tokens ∩ candidate_tokens|
+partial_hits    = prefix/substring matches (min_partial_match_chars)
+effective       = exact_hits + partial_hits × partial_hit_weight
+overlap_ratio   = effective / |hint_tokens|
+bonus           = min(max_bonus, overlap_ratio × max_bonus)
+```
+
+Returns `max(current_employer_bonus, previous_employer_bonus)`.
+
+Match levels: `none` → `partial` → `exact`.
+
+### Anchor resolution (`AnchorResolution.py`)
+
+Controlled by `AppConfig.data.processing.use_anchor_enriched_features` (default `true`):
+
+| Mode | Anchor source |
+|---|---|
+| `true` | `TransactionFeatures.is_anchor` after `AnchorFlags.attach_anchor_flags` |
+| `false` | `AppliedHints.anchors` directly |
+
+Used by skeleton grouping and graph clustering for anchor presence bonuses.
+
+## Input / output contract
+
+### Input
+
+```
+credits:     Iterable[BankTransaction]   # with features from Phase 3
+hint_inputs: HintInputs | None
+```
+
+### Output: `HintApplicationResult`
+
+```python
+@dataclass(frozen=True)
+class HintApplicationResult:
+    applied_hints: AppliedHints
+    hint_inputs: HintInputs
+    warnings: tuple[ValidationWarning, ...]
+```
+
+### `AppliedHints` structure
+
+```
+anchors                 tuple[AnchorMatch, ...]
+unmatched_hint_ids      tuple[str, ...]
+effective_monthly       Decimal | None
+band_lower / band_upper Decimal | None
+gift                    AppliedGiftHints | None
+rent                    AppliedRentHints | None
+property_sale           AppliedPropertySaleHints | None
+```
+
+Helper functions: `anchor_txn_ids()`, `ambiguous_anchor_ids()`.
+
+## Confidence scoring
+
+Hints do not assign per-transaction confidence directly. They produce **modifiers and flags** used later:
+
+### Band modifier (`band_modifier`) — FR-017 downstream
+
+Applied to skeleton amount plausibility and scoring when cluster median is compared to salary band:
+
+```
+if band is None or band.contains(cluster_median):
+    modifier = 1.0
+else:
+    distance = band.lower − median  (or median − band.upper if above)
+    relative = distance / effective_monthly
+    modifier = max(floor, min(1.0, 1.0 − 0.5 × relative))
+```
+
+Default `floor = 0.5` from `hint_config.yaml`.
+
+### Employer hint bonus — Phase 10 scoring
+
+| Hint | Max bonus (default YAML) |
+|---|---|
+| Current employer | `0.10` |
+| Previous employer | `0.05` |
+| Partial token hit weight | `0.5` |
+
+### Anchor presence — Phases 5–6
+
+| Phase | Anchor effect |
+|---|---|
+| Skeleton grouping | `anchor_presence = 1.0` → floor final plausibility at `0.55` |
+| Graph clustering | `+0.15` interim candidate confidence when anchor in cluster |
+
+### Payslip warnings
+
+Unmatched payslip hints → `ValidationWarning(code="hint_unmatched", …)` — no score impact, audit only.
+
+## Configuration
+
+Source: `config/hint_config.yaml` via `load_hint_config()`.
+
+| Key | Default | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `schema_validation.enabled` | `true` | Hint payload schema gate |
+| `schema_validation.strict` | `true` | |
+| `default_tolerance_pct` | `0.20` | Salary band when not overridden in hint |
+| `month_pattern` | `^\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])$` | Payslip hint month validation |
+| `employer_hint_stop_tokens` | BACS, LTD, SALARY, … | Stripped from employer name tokenisation |
+| `min_partial_match_chars` | `8` | Substring partial match threshold |
+| `min_employer_token_length` | `2` | Minimum token length |
+| `employer_bonus.max_current_bonus` | `0.10` | Scoring bonus cap |
+| `employer_bonus.max_previous_bonus` | `0.05` | |
+| `employer_bonus.partial_hit_weight` | `0.5` | Weight for partial token overlap |
+| `band_modifier.floor` | `0.5` | Minimum band modifier |
+
+### AppConfig processing flag
+
+| Path | Default | Effect |
+|---|---|---|
+| `processing.use_anchor_enriched_features` | `true` | Read anchors from enriched features vs raw `AppliedHints` |
+
+## Logging
+
+| Level | Content |
+|---|---|
+| INFO | Phase start/done (`phase=hints`) |
+| TRACE | Hint counts, anchor matches, unmatched ids |
+| DEBUG | Per-hint match decisions |
+
+Logger: `nw_agcore_bank_transactions.channels.tools.hints.BankTransactionHintTools`.
+
+## Flow
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[credits + HintInputs] --> PARSE[HintInputsParsing optional]
+    PARSE --> SVC[BankTransactionHintService.apply_hints]
+    SVC --> PAY{payslip_hints?}
+    PAY -- yes --> ANC[apply_payslip_hints → anchors]
+    PAY -- no --> BAND
+    ANC --> BAND{salary_hints?}
+    BAND -- yes --> SB[apply_salary_band]
+    BAND -- no --> DOM
+    SB --> DOM{domain hints?}
+    DOM --> GIFT[apply_gift_hints]
+    DOM --> RENT[apply_rent_hints]
+    DOM --> SALE[apply_property_sale_hints]
+    GIFT --> MERGE[AppliedHints merge]
+    RENT --> MERGE
+    SALE --> MERGE
+    MERGE --> WARN[_unmatched_warnings]
+    WARN --> OUT[HintApplicationResult]
+```
+
+### Payslip anchor match
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    H[PayslipHint month + amount] --> BUCKET[Credits in same YYYY-MM]
+    BUCKET --> MATCH{Amount exact match?}
+    MATCH -- no --> UNM[unmatched_hint_ids]
+    MATCH -- yes --> AMB{Multiple matches?}
+    AMB -- yes --> ANC1[AnchorMatch ambiguous=True]
+    AMB -- no --> ANC2[AnchorMatch ambiguous=False]
+    ANC1 --> FLAGS[AnchorFlags.attach_anchor_flags]
+    ANC2 --> FLAGS
+```
