+# Candidate Scoring (Phase 11)
+
+Canonical confidence assignment for bank-transaction candidate sets. Builds weighted composite
+scores from recurrence, description, amount, channel, coverage, and hint signals; classifies
+`candidate_type`; renders reasoning and risks; and records a step-level audit trail via
+`ConfidenceAccumulator`. Implements Design §11–§13.
+
+Also hosts **profile modules** for rent recurrence scoring and gift/property-sale hint-amount
+scoring (invoked by separate tools, not the salary orchestrator path).
+
+## Table of contents
+
+- [Pipeline position](#pipeline-position)
+- [Entry points](#entry-points)
+- [Inputs and outputs](#inputs-and-outputs)
+- [Salary composite score](#salary-composite-score)
+- [ConfidenceAccumulator](#confidenceaccumulator)
+- [Confidence bands](#confidence-bands)
+- [Candidate type classification](#candidate-type-classification)
+- [Amount classification](#amount-classification)
+- [Scoring profiles](#scoring-profiles)
+- [Post-processing](#post-processing)
+- [Configuration](#configuration)
+- [Warnings and edge cases](#warnings-and-edge-cases)
+- [Flow](#flow)
+- [Sequence diagram](#sequence-diagram)
+- [Key source files](#key-source-files)
+- [Tests](#tests)
+- [Related modules](#related-modules)
+
+## Pipeline position
+
+| Property | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Phase number | 11 |
+| Audit phase name | `scoring` |
+| Upstream | Phases 3–10 candidates (features, hints, skeleton/graph, bonus split, fallback) |
+| Downstream | Phase 12 `employment_transition/` → Phase 13 `ranking/` |
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart LR
+    POOL[Candidate pool] --> SCORE[run_score_candidate_pool]
+    SCORE --> REC[RecurrenceProfile.score_recurrence_pool]
+    REC --> COMPUTE[ScoringService.compute_score]
+    COMPUTE --> ACC[ConfidenceAccumulator]
+    ACC --> CLASS[CandidateType.classify]
+    CLASS --> POST[infer_regions + gap_periods]
+    POST --> OUT[ScoringToolResult]
+```
+
+## Entry points
+
+### Salary path (primary)
+
+```python
+from nw_agcore_bank_transactions.channels.tools.scoring import run_score_candidate_pool
+
+result = run_score_candidate_pool(
+    pool,
+    normalised=normalised,
+    features_by_id=features_by_id,
+    calendar=calendar,
+    config=config,
+    applied_hints=applied_hints,
+    salary_hints=salary_hints,
+    employer_hints=employer_hints,
+    transactions_range=transactions_range,
+    infer_regions=True,
+    audit=audit,
+    warnings=warnings,
+)
+scored = list(result.scored)
+```
+
+### Profile-specific tools
+
+| Tool | Profile | Use case |
+|---|---|---|
+| `run_score_recurrence_pool` | `salary` \| `rent` | Recurrence-based detectors |
+| `run_score_hint_groups` | `gift` \| `property_sale` | Hint-amount grouped candidates |
+
+| Layer | File | Role |
+|---|---|---|
+| Tool | `ScoringTools.py` | `run_score_candidate_pool`, profile variants |
+| Core | `ScoringService.py` | Composite score, `score_candidate` |
+| Accumulator | `ConfidenceAccumulator.py` | Step audit + TRACE |
+| Classification | `CandidateType.py` | `classify_candidate_type` |
+| Amount | `AmountClassificationService.py` | Amount regime models |
+| Post-process | `ScoringPostProcess.py` | Region inference, gap periods |
+| Rejection | `NegativeKeywordRejection.py` | Hard reject near-miss tagging |
+| Profiles | `profiles/*.py` | Salary, rent, gift, property sale |
+| Config | `config/scoring_config.yaml`, `amount_config.yaml`, `candidate_generation.yaml` |
+| REST | `routes/ScoringRoute.py` | `/api/v1/scoring/score` |
+
+### REST endpoint
+
+| Property | Value |
+|---|---|
+| Method | `POST` |
+| Path | `/api/v1/scoring/score` |
+| OpenAPI | `routes/openapi/run_score_candidate_pool.openapi.yaml` |
+
+## Inputs and outputs
+
+### Input (salary scoring)
+
+| Field | Type | Notes |
+|---|---|---|
+| `pool` | `Iterable[CandidateSet]` | Placeholder candidates from generation phases |
+| `normalised` | `Sequence[BankTransaction]` | Full transaction list for cluster lookup |
+| `features_by_id` | `Mapping[str, TransactionFeatures]` | Phase 3 features |
+| `calendar` | `WorkingDayCalendar` | Recurrence fitting |
+| `config` | `AppConfig` | Weights, penalties, bonuses, amount settings |
+| `applied_hints` | `AppliedHints \| None` | Anchor flags, effective salary band |
+| `salary_hints` | `SalaryHints \| None` | Band computation |
+| `employer_hints` | optional | Employer name match floors |
+| `transactions_range` | `TransactionsRange \| None` | Gap summary denominator override |
+
+### Output: `ScoringToolResult`
+
+```python
+@dataclass(frozen=True)
+class ScoringToolResult(BaseToolModel):
+    scored: tuple[CandidateSet, ...] = ()
+    inferred_regions: tuple[str, ...] = ()
+    warnings: tuple[ValidationWarning, ...] = ()
+```
+
+Each scored `CandidateSet` gains:
+
+- filled `ScoreBreakdown` (dataclass serialised to dict on wire),
+- `candidate_type` from classification cascade,
+- `confidence` / `confidence_band` from `final_score`,
+- `confidence_details` — ordered `ConfidenceDetail` steps,
+- `reasoning`, `risks`, enriched `metadata` (`gap_summary`, `sequence_consistency`, …).
+
+## Salary composite score
+
+Implemented in `ScoringService.compute_score`.
+
+### Weighted sum
+
+Default weights from `scoring_config.yaml`:
+
+\[
+\begin{aligned}
+\text{raw\_score} =\;& W_{\text{date}} \cdot s_{\text{date}}
+  + W_{\text{desc}} \cdot s_{\text{desc}}
+  + W_{\text{amount}} \cdot (s_{\text{amount}} \times m_{\text{band}}) \\
+  &+ W_{\text{channel}} \cdot s_{\text{channel}}
+  + W_{\text{cov}} \cdot s_{\text{coverage}}
+  + W_{\text{ctx}} \cdot s_{\text{context}}
+\end{aligned}
+\]
+
+| Weight key | Default | Sub-score source |
+|---|---|---|
+| `date_pattern_score` | 0.30 | `RecurrenceFit.fit_score` |
+| `description_similarity_score` | 0.25 | Pairwise Jaccard + employer bonus |
+| `amount_consistency_score` | 0.20 | `AmountFit.score × band_modifier` |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.10 | Dominant channel table |
+| `coverage_score` | 0.10 | `RecurrenceFit.coverage` |
+| `context_bonus` | 0.05 | Employer + payroll hint alignment |
+
+### Additive adjustments
+
+\[
+\text{final} = \clamp\left(
+  \text{raw\_score} + b_{\text{anchor}} + b_{\text{employer}} + p_{\text{negative}},\;
+  0,\; 1
+\right)
+\]
+
+| Adjustment | Default cap | Rule |
+|---|---|---|
+| `anchor_bonus` | `max_anchor_bonus` = 0.15 | `min(max, per_anchor × matched_anchors)`; `per_anchor` = 0.05 |
+| `employer_hint_bonus` | `max_employer_hint_bonus` = 0.10 | Token overlap via `employer_hint_bonus()` |
+| `negative_signal_penalty` | `max_negative_signal_penalty` = -0.20 | Linear in fraction of txns with `negative_tokens` |
+
+### Employer match confidence floor
+
+When `raw_score ≥ employer_match_min_base_score` (0.45):
+
+| Match level | Floor applied to `final` |
+|---|---|
+| `exact` | `employer_exact_match_floor` = 0.92 |
+| `partial` | `employer_partial_match_floor` = 0.85 |
+
+Recorded as `ConfidenceAccumulator.set_running(stage="employer_match_floor", …)`.
+
+### Sub-score helpers
+
+**Description** — average pairwise Jaccard on `description_tokens`; +0.05 capped at 1.0 when
+≥2 transactions share employer tokens.
+
+**Channel** (`channel_score`) — dominant `payment_channel` with payroll-hint blend, e.g.
+`bacs_or_direct_credit` → 0.95 with hint / 0.65 without.
+
+**Context** (`context_bonus`) — up to 0.05 when ≥80% of cluster has employer tokens and ≥50%
+has strong payroll hints.
+
+**Negative penalty** — `max_penalty × (flagged_count / len(features))`, clamped to
+`[max_penalty, 0]`.
+
+### Amount-date fallback cap (phase 13 integration)
+
+If `candidate.metadata["source"] == "amount_date_fallback"`:
+
+\[
+\text{final\_score} = \min(\text{final\_score},\; \text{fallback\_confidence\_cap})
+\]
+
+Default cap 0.55; `candidate_type` forced to `unknown_recurring_credit`.
+
+## ConfidenceAccumulator
+
+`ConfidenceAccumulator` maintains a running total with per-step audit records and TRACE logs.
+
+### API
+
+| Method | Purpose |
+|---|---|
+| `apply_delta(stage, amount, max_value, reasoning, data)` | Add signed delta; clamp to `[0, 1]` |
+| `set_running(stage, target, max_value, reasoning, data)` | Set absolute level (floors) |
+| `multiply(stage, factor, reasoning, data)` | Scale running total (rent amount modifier) |
+| `as_tuple()` | Export `tuple[ConfidenceDetail, …]` |
+
+Each step produces:
+
+```python
+ConfidenceDetail(
+    step="date_pattern",           # stage name
+    confidence_step=0.25,          # signed delta applied
+    confidence_step_max_value=0.30,# ceiling for this component
+    reasoning="Date recurrence fit score (weight 0.30)",
+    data={"weight": 0.30, "sub_score": 0.833},
+)
+```
+
+TRACE format:
+
+```text
+[confidence_calculation][date_pattern]  candidate=…  amount=+0.250000  confidence=0.250000  reasoning=…  data={…}
+```
+
+Salary scoring stages (in order): `date_pattern`, `description_similarity`, `amount_consistency`,
+`payment_channel`, `coverage`, `context_bonus`, `anchor_bonus`, `employer_hint_bonus`,
+`negative_signal_penalty`, optional `employer_match_floor`.
+
+Rent profile adds: `rent_date_pattern`, `rent_keyword_score`, `rentee_hint_bonus`,
+`rent_amount_modifier` (multiply), `rentee_*_match_floor`.
+
+## Confidence bands
+
+`ScoringService.confidence_band(score)` — Design §6.4:
+
+| Band | Threshold (≥) |
+|---|---|
+| `very_high` | 0.92 |
+| `high` | 0.85 |
+| `medium_high` | 0.70 |
+| `medium` | 0.55 |
+| `low` | 0.40 |
+| `very_low` | 0.0 |
+
+Mirrored in `scoring_config.yaml` → `thresholds` and `_models/CandidateTypes.CONFIDENCE_BANDS`.
+
+`CandidateSet.__post_init__` validates `confidence_band` ∈ `CONFIDENCE_BANDS`.
+
+## Candidate type classification
+
+`CandidateType.classify_candidate_type` — Design §12 cascade (first match wins):
+
+| Priority | Condition | `candidate_type` |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | ≥50% of cluster carries non-salary negative tokens (DWP, PENSION, …) | `recurring_income_not_salary_candidate` |
+| 2 | `AmountModel.ONE_OFF_FINAL_PAY_OUTLIER` | `final_pay_candidate` |
+| 3 | `AmountModel.BONUS_OR_EXTRA_PAY_OUTLIER` | `bonus_or_extra_pay_candidate` |
+| 4 | `TOO_VARIABLE` + low channel + employer tokens | `expense_reimbursement_candidate` |
+| 5 | `final_score ≥ 0.70` | `probable_salary` |
+| 6 | `final_score ≥ 0.55` | `possible_salary` |
+| 7 | default | `unknown_recurring_credit` |
+
+`reason_key` stored in `metadata.classification_reason_key` for reasoning templates.
+
+## Amount classification
+
+`AmountClassificationService.classify_amount_pattern` — Design §9.
+
+| Model | Condition | Score |
+|---|---|---|
+| `STABLE` | CV ≤ `stable_pct_tolerance` (0.02) | 1.0 |
+| `ONE_OFF_FINAL_PAY_OUTLIER` | single MAD outlier at start/end, stable remainder | 0.80 |
+| `BONUS_OR_EXTRA_PAY_OUTLIER` | single interior MAD outlier | 0.75 |
+| `STABLE_WITH_STEP_CHANGE` | split with stable segments, step ≥ 5% | 0.85 |
+| `STABLE_WITH_MINOR_VARIATION` | CV ≤ `moderate_pct_tolerance` (0.10) | 0.80 |
+| `VARIABLE_BUT_RECURRING` | CV ≤ `variable_max_cv` (0.30) | 0.55 |
+| `TOO_VARIABLE` | else | 0.20 |
+
+Outlier detection: MAD ratio ≥ `outlier_mad_ratio` (3.0), minimum 4 transactions.
+
+## Scoring profiles
+
+### RecurrenceProfile (`profiles/RecurrenceProfile.py`)
+
+Delegates each `CandidateSet` to `ScoringService.score_candidate`. Propagates cluster-level
+confidence to each `CandidateTransaction` and merges transaction-level `confidence_details`.
+
+### RentProfile (`profiles/RentProfile.py`)
+
+Custom weighted score for rent hints:
+
+\[
+\text{final} = w_d s_{\text{rent\_date}} + w_{\text{desc}} s_{\text{desc}} + w_a s_{\text{amount}} + w_c s_{\text{channel}} + w_{\text{cov}} s_{\text{cov}} + 0.10 \cdot s_{\text{keyword}} + b_{\text{rentee}}
+\]
+
+Uses `ConfidenceAccumulator` throughout. Optional `multiply(factor=0.75)` when hint amount
+mismatch. Classification: `probable_rent` / `possible_rent` / `recurring_income_not_rent`.
+
+### GiftProfile (`profiles/GiftProfile.py`)
+
+Hint-amount groups from `hint_grouping/`:
+
+\[
+\text{final} = \min\left(1,\; \left(\sum_i w_i s_i\right) \times m_{\text{overpay}}\right)
+\]
+
+| Component | Default weight |
+|---|---|
+| `amount_minimum_score` | 0.35 |
+| `exact_amount_bonus_weight` | 0.15 |
+| `gift_keyword_score` | 0.20 |
+| `donor_hint_bonus` | 0.15 |
+| `date_proximity_score` | 0.10 |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 |
+
+Floors: exact gift match (0.85), donor exact (0.92), donor partial (0.85). Types:
+`probable_gift` / `possible_gift` / `large_credit_not_gift`.
+
+### PropertySaleProfile (`profiles/PropertySaleProfile.py`)
+
+\[
+\text{final} = \sum_i w_i s_i
+\]
+
+| Component | Default weight |
+|---|---|
+| `amount_coverage_score` | 0.50 |
+| `per_txn_amount_fit_score` | 0.10 |
+| `description_keyword_score` | 0.15 |
+| `buyer_hint_bonus` | 0.10 |
+| `property_hint_bonus` | 0.10 |
+| `payment_channel_score` | 0.05 |
+| `timeline_fit_score` | 0.10 |
+
+Types: `probable_property_sale` (conf ≥ 0.55 and coverage ≥ 90%) /
+`possible_property_sale` / `large_credit_not_property_sale`.
+
+## Post-processing
+
+### Region inference (`ScoringPostProcess.infer_regions`)
+
+For monthly-frequency candidates, re-fits recurrence per UK region
+(`EnglandAndWales`, `Scotland`, `NorthernIreland`). Stores `metadata.inferred_regions` and
+`region_fit_scores`. Emits `ValidationWarning(code="ambiguous_region")` when candidates disagree.
+
+### Gap periods (`ScoringPostProcess.apply_gap_periods`)
+
+Reads `metadata.gap_summary.missing_months`. Emits `missing_salary_periods` warnings. Builds
+`GapPeriodCandidate` entries from `metadata.orphan_credits` aligned to missing months.
+
+### Negative keyword rejection (`NegativeKeywordRejection.py`)
+
+Used by ranking/detector — partitions scored sets where any transaction has `negative_tokens`;
+tags `metadata.near_miss_reason = "negative_keyword_match"`.
+
+## Configuration
+
+### `config/scoring_config.yaml`
+
+```yaml
+weights:           # composite sub-score weights (sum = 1.0)
+penalties:         # max_negative_signal_penalty, per_marker map
+bonuses:           # anchor, employer, match floors
+thresholds:        # band cutoffs + return_threshold (0.40)
+```
+
+### `config/amount_config.yaml`
+
+Amount regime tolerances (`stable_pct_tolerance`, `moderate_pct_tolerance`, `variable_max_cv`,
+`outlier_mad_ratio`, `step_change_min_pct`).
+
+### `config/candidate_generation.yaml`
+
+Shared caps (`max_candidates_to_return`, `max_near_misses`, monthly gap bounds for rent profile).
+
+Profile-specific weights/thresholds for gift/rent/property-sale are passed as kwargs to
+`run_score_hint_groups` / `run_score_recurrence_pool` (typically from business-agent config).
+
+## Warnings and edge cases
+
+| Code | Source | When |
+|---|---|---|
+| `ambiguous_region` | `infer_regions` | Multiple UK regions tie within 0.05 fit delta across candidates |
+| `missing_salary_periods` | `apply_gap_periods` | `gap_summary.missing_months` non-empty |
+| `negative_keyword_match` | `NegativeKeywordRejection` | Near-miss tagging (not a ValidationWarning) |
+
+**Sequence consistency** — when Jaccard ≥ 0.6, sequence score &lt; 0.7, cluster ≥ 3 txns, an extra
+risk string is appended (Enhancement C).
+
+**Single-transaction clusters** — description score 0; recurrence fit empty; classification
+biased toward outlier / unknown types.
+
+## Flow
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TD
+    IN[pool + normalised + features] --> LOOP[For each CandidateSet]
+    LOOP --> CLUSTER[Resolve BankTransaction cluster]
+    CLUSTER --> REC[fit_best_recurrence_model]
+    REC --> AMT[classify_amount_pattern]
+    AMT --> SUB[Compute sub-scores: desc, channel, context, coverage]
+    SUB --> RAW[raw_score = weighted sum]
+    RAW --> ADJ[+ anchor + employer + negative penalty]
+    ADJ --> FLOOR{Employer match floor?}
+    FLOOR -- yes --> SET[ConfidenceAccumulator.set_running]
+    FLOOR -- no --> ACC[ConfidenceAccumulator.apply_delta steps]
+    SET --> ACC
+    ACC --> CLASS[classify_candidate_type]
+    CLASS --> REASON[build_reasoning + build_risks]
+    REASON --> FALLBACK{amount_date_fallback?}
+    FALLBACK -- yes --> CAP[Clamp at 0.55, force unknown_recurring_credit]
+    FALLBACK -- no --> OUTC[Scored CandidateSet]
+    CAP --> OUTC
+    OUTC --> POST[infer_regions + apply_gap_periods]
+    POST --> RES[ScoringToolResult]
+```
+
+## Sequence diagram
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant Client
+    participant Tool as BankTransactionScoringTools
+    participant Prof as RecurrenceProfile
+    participant Svc as ScoringService
+    participant Acc as ConfidenceAccumulator
+    participant Post as ScoringPostProcess
+
+    Client->>Tool: run_score_candidate_pool(...)
+    Tool->>Prof: score_recurrence_pool(pool, ...)
+    loop each candidate
+        Prof->>Svc: score_candidate(cand, cluster, ...)
+        Svc->>Svc: compute_score → sub-scores
+        Svc->>Acc: apply_delta / set_running (audit trail)
+        Acc-->>Svc: confidence_details
+        Svc->>Svc: classify + reasoning + risks
+    end
+    Prof-->>Tool: list[CandidateSet]
+    Tool->>Post: infer_regions(scored, ...)
+    Tool->>Post: apply_gap_periods(scored, warnings)
+    Post-->>Tool: enriched scored + warnings
+    Tool-->>Client: ScoringToolResult
+```
+
