+# nw-core
+
+**Package:** `nw-core`  
+**Module:** `nw_core`  
+**Role:** Shared foundation for NW components — channel bootstrapping, configuration, structured logging, UK calendar, validation, and gRPC helpers.
+
+This library is consumed by `nw-aglib-toolkit`, core agents, business agents, and application templates.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Architecture](#architecture)
+- [Module index](#module-index)
+- [Quick start](#quick-start)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Modules](#modules)
+  - [channels — Channel modules and deployment](#channels--channel-modules-and-deployment)
+  - [config — Component settings](#config--component-settings)
+  - [logging — Structured logging](#logging--structured-logging)
+  - [calendar — UK working-day calendar](#calendar--uk-working-day-calendar)
+  - [validation — Schema checking](#validation--schema-checking)
+  - [grpc — Protobuf JSON helpers](#grpc--protobuf-json-helpers)
+- [gRPC contracts](#grpc-contracts)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+  - [Test layout](#test-layout)
+  - [Prerequisites](#prerequisites)
+  - [Commands](#commands)
+  - [Markers](#markers)
+  - [Coverage configuration](#coverage-configuration)
+  - [Notes](#notes)
+
+---
+
+## Architecture
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph nw_core [nw_core]
+        Channels[channels]
+        Config[config]
+        Logging[logging]
+        Calendar[calendar]
+        Validation[validation]
+        Grpc[grpc]
+    end
+
+    subgraph consumers [Consumers]
+        Toolkit[nw-aglib-toolkit]
+        Agents[core and business agents]
+        Apps[application templates]
+    end
+
+    Toolkit --> Channels
+    Toolkit --> Config
+    Agents --> Channels
+    Agents --> Logging
+    Agents --> Calendar
+    Agents --> Validation
+    Apps --> Config
+    Apps --> Channels
+```
+
+---
+
+## Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `channels.ChannelModules` | Channel registry, runtime, REST/gRPC/MQ modules |
+| `channels.ChannelDeployment` | Deployment manifest loading and bootstrap |
+| `channels.rest.RestFactory` | FastAPI app factory and router mounting |
+| `channels.grpc.GrpcServer` | gRPC server bootstrap |
+| `channels.mq.MqAdapter` | MQ adapter contract and stub |
+| `config.ComponentSettings` | Pydantic settings from `config/env.{NW_ENV}` |
+| `logging` | TRACE level, `LogFn`, call-context annotations |
+| `calendar` | UK working-day calendar with bank holidays |
+| `validation` | `ValidationWarning` and JSON-schema checking |
+| `grpc.ProtoJson` | Protobuf ↔ dict conversion helpers |
