+## Testing
+
+### Test layout
+
+Test files use Java-style PascalCase names aligned with source modules: `{Module}Test.py` (e.g. `ComponentSettings.py` → `ComponentSettingsTest.py`).
+
+```
+tests/
+├── unit/          # Isolated unit tests (@pytest.mark.unit)
+└── feature/       # Component feature tests (@pytest.mark.feature)
+```
+
+| Test file | Source module |
+|-----------|---------------|
+| `unit/ComponentSettingsTest.py` | `config/ComponentSettings.py` |
+| `unit/AppComponentSettingsTest.py` | `config/ComponentSettings.py` (`AppComponentSettings`) |
+| `unit/LoggingTest.py` | `logging/Logging.py`, `logging/LogFnAnnotation.py` |
+| `unit/WorkingDayCalendarTest.py` | `calendar/WorkingDayCalendar.py` |
+| `unit/SchemaCheckServiceTest.py` | `validation/schema/SchemaCheckService.py` |
+| `unit/ProtoJsonTest.py` | `grpc/ProtoJson.py` |
+| `unit/MqAdapterTest.py` | `channels/mq/MqAdapter.py` |
+| `feature/ChannelDeploymentTest.py` | `channels/ChannelDeployment.py` |
+| `feature/RestFactoryTest.py` | `channels/rest/RestFactory.py` |
