+# @nw/ui-bank-statement
+
+React components for reviewing bank statement OCR extraction results: annotated page images on the left, extracted account details and transactions on the right.
+
+## Usage
+
+```tsx
+import { BankStatementRenderer } from "@nw/ui-bank-statement";
+import { sampleStatement } from "@nw/ui-bank-statement";
+
+<BankStatementRenderer document={sampleStatement} />
+```
+
+## Data contract
+
+Annotations use normalized bounding boxes (`x1`, `y1`, `x2`, `y2` in `[0, 1]`) aligned with Doctr and img2table output. See `src/types.ts` for the full schema.
