+# nw-common-tests
+
+**Package:** `nw-common-tests`  
+**Paths:** `tests/` (workspace root for this package)  
+**Role:** Monorepo test hub — shared pytest utilities (`nw_common_tests`) and cross-agent YAML feature scenarios (`tests/feature`).
+
+This directory is a uv workspace member. It is **not** production code: it provides dev-only helpers consumed by every package's test suite and hosts the root feature scenario runner.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Architecture](#architecture)
+- [Layout](#layout)
+- [Module index](#module-index)
+- [Quick start](#quick-start)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [nw_common_tests library](#nw_common_tests-library)
+- [Feature scenario suite](#feature-scenario-suite)
+  - [Scenario layout](#scenario-layout)
+  - [Support modules](#support-modules)
+  - [Pytest flags](#pytest-flags)
+  - [Standalone runner](#standalone-runner)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+  - [Test layout](#test-layout)
+  - [Prerequisites](#prerequisites)
+  - [Commands](#commands)
+  - [Markers](#markers)
+  - [Notes](#notes)
+
+---
+
+## Architecture
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph tests_pkg [tests/ workspace package]
+        CommonTests[nw_common_tests]
+        Feature[feature/]
+        Unit[unit/]
+    end
+
+    subgraph feature_detail [feature/]
+        ScenariosTest[ScenariosTest.py]
+        Runner[Runner.py]
+        Support[support/]
+        YAML[scenarios + scenarios_stress]
+    end
+
+    subgraph agents [Agent-local scenarios]
+        Salary[salary-extractor/scenarios]
+        Rent[rent-extractor/scenarios]
+        Gift[gift-extractor/scenarios]
+        Sale[property-sale-extractor/scenarios]
+    end
+
+    subgraph consumers [Monorepo]
+        RootConftest[repo conftest.py]
+        AllPytest[all pytest invocations]
+        BankTx[bank-transactions tests]
+        Toolkit[toolkit tests]
+    end
+
+    RootConftest --> CommonTests
+    AllPytest --> CommonTests
+    ScenariosTest --> Support
+    Runner --> Support
+    Support --> agents
+    BankTx --> Support
+    Toolkit --> Support
+```
+
+---
+
+## Layout
+
+```
+tests/
+├── pyproject.toml              # nw-common-tests workspace package
+├── README.md                   # this file
+├── src/nw_common_tests/        # importable shared pytest library
+│   ├── README.md               # library module reference
+│   ├── Env.py
+│   ├── Fixtures.py
+│   ├── Markers.py
+│   └── PytestHooks.py
+├── unit/                       # unit tests for nw_common_tests
+│   └── EnvTest.py
+└── feature/                    # cross-agent YAML scenario suite
+    ├── conftest.py             # pytest plugin (scenario parametrization)
+    ├── ScenariosTest.py        # parametrized feature tests
+    ├── Runner.py               # standalone CLI runner (no pytest)
+    ├── scenarios/              # combination scenarios
+    ├── scenarios_stress/       # employment stress scenarios
+    └── support/                # discovery, detection, logging helpers
+```
+
+Python modules use Java-style PascalCase filenames (`Env.py`, `ScenariosTest.py`, `DetectScenario.py`, …). Test files use `{Module}Test.py`.
+
+---
+
+## Module index
+
+### nw_common_tests
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `Env` | Force `NW_ENV=test` |
+| `Fixtures` | Shared pytest fixtures (`test_client_factory`) |
+| `Markers` | `smoke` / `regression` marker helpers |
+| `PytestHooks` | Repo-wide pytest plugin (TRACE, log context, env) |
+
+See [`src/nw_common_tests/README.md`](src/nw_common_tests/README.md) for full library documentation.
+
+### feature
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `ScenariosTest` | Parametrized `@pytest.mark.feature` tests — one YAML = one case |
+| `Runner` | Standalone scenario runner (`python -m tests.feature.Runner`) |
+| `support.ScenarioDiscovery` | Discover YAML fixtures across agent dirs |
+| `support.DetectScenario` | Route scenario to the correct business-agent detector |
+| `support.DetectFromFixture` | Employment (bank-transactions) detection path |
+| `support.FixtureScenario` | Typed wrapper around a YAML fixture file |
+| `support.PayloadIo` | Parse transaction payloads from fixture dicts |
+| `support.Payload` | Load scenarios for benchmarks and tooling |
+| `support.HintIo` | Build hint inputs from fixture dicts |
+| `support.ConfigSchema` | Validate merged config against JSON schema (tests only) |
+| `support.DetectKwargs` | Read `expected.detect_kwargs` from fixtures |
+| `support.TestLogging` | TRACE-aware logging and candidate dumps for feature runs |
+
+---
+
+## Quick start
+
+```bash
+# From monorepo root after bootstrap
+./scripts/bootstrap.sh
+
+# nw_common_tests unit tests
+uv run --package nw-common-tests pytest
+
+# Feature scenarios (all modules)
+uv run pytest tests/feature -m feature
+
+# One module with TRACE logging
+uv run pytest tests/feature --module=employment -m feature -v --log-cli-level=TRACE
+```
+
+---
+
+## Dependencies
+
+Declared in `tests/pyproject.toml`:
+
+| Dependency | Purpose |
+|------------|---------|
+| `nw-core` | Logging, TRACE, settings |
+| `pytest` | Test runner and plugin hooks |
+| `fastapi`, `httpx` | `TestClient` fixture |
+
+Feature scenarios additionally require business-agent packages (`nw-agbus-*`) and `nw-agcore-bank-transactions` to be synced via workspace `uv sync --all-packages`.
+
+---
+
+## nw_common_tests library
+
+Importable package at `tests/src/nw_common_tests/`. Loaded globally through root [`conftest.py`](../conftest.py):
+
+```python
+pytest_plugins = ["nw_common_tests.PytestHooks"]
+```
+
+Other packages import helpers directly:
+
+```python
+from nw_common_tests.Env import force_test_env
+from tests.feature.support.ConfigSchema import validate_merged_config
+from tests.feature.support.HintIo import hint_inputs_from_dict
+```
+
+---
+
+## Feature scenario suite
+
+### Scenario layout
+
+| Module key | Scenario directory |
+|------------|-------------------|
+| `employment` | `tests/feature/scenarios/employment/` |
+| `rent` | `tests/feature/scenarios/rent/` |
+| `gift` | `tests/feature/scenarios/gift/` |
+| `property_sale` | `tests/feature/scenarios/property_sale/` |
+| `combination` | `tests/feature/scenarios/combination/` |
+| `employment_stress` | `tests/feature/scenarios_stress/` |
+
+Evidence JSON is written to `.plan/reviews/feature-outputs/{module}/{stem}.json`.
+
+### Support modules
+
+`tests/feature/support/` holds shared infrastructure used by `ScenariosTest`, `Runner`, bank-transactions unit tests, toolkit config tests, and benchmarks. Modules are PascalCase and map 1:1 to filenames (see [module index](#module-index)).
+
+### Pytest flags
+
+Defined in `tests/feature/conftest.py`:
+
+| Flag | Purpose |
+|------|---------|
+| `--module=NAME` | Filter by logical module (repeat for OR) |
+| `--rw-fixture=GLOB` | Filter by scenario stem glob |
+| `--rw-tag=TAG` | Require tag in `scenario_tags` (repeat for AND) |
+| `--rw-list` | List discovered fixtures and exit |
+| `--rw-help` | Show feature test help and exit |
+
+### Standalone runner
+
+Run scenarios without pytest:
+
+```bash
+python -m tests.feature.Runner --help
+python -m tests.feature.Runner --module employment
+python -m tests.feature.Runner --module rent "Rent_801_*"
+```
+
+---
+
+## Testing
+
+### Test layout
+
+| Test file | Source module |
+|-----------|---------------|
+| `unit/EnvTest.py` | `src/nw_common_tests/Env.py` |
+| `unit/FixturesTest.py` | `src/nw_common_tests/Fixtures.py` |
+| `unit/MarkersTest.py` | `src/nw_common_tests/Markers.py` |
+| `unit/PytestHooksTest.py` | `src/nw_common_tests/PytestHooks.py` |
+| `feature/ScenariosTest.py` | `feature/support/*` + agent detectors |
+
+### Prerequisites
+
+```bash
+uv sync --all-packages
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+```bash
+# nw_common_tests only (from tests/ directory)
+cd tests && uv run pytest unit/ -m unit
+
+# nw_common_tests via workspace package name
+uv run --package nw-common-tests pytest
+
+# Feature scenarios
+uv run pytest tests/feature -m feature
+uv run pytest tests/feature --module=gift -m feature
+pnpm test:feature          # package.json wrapper
+
+# List all scenarios
+uv run pytest tests/feature --rw-list
+```
+
+### Markers
+
+| Marker | Purpose |
+|--------|---------|
+| `unit` | `nw_common_tests` library tests |
+| `feature` | YAML scenario fixture tests |
+| `smoke`, `regression`, `e2e` | Defined at workspace root; used by agent packages |
+
+### Notes
+
+- `tests/feature/conftest.py` remains snake_case — pytest convention for local plugins.
+- `python_files = ["*Test.py", "test_*.py"]` in `tests/pyproject.toml`.
+- `pythonpath = ["src"]` for `nw_common_tests` imports when running from `tests/`.
+- Root `pyproject.toml` sets `pythonpath = ["."]` so `tests.feature.*` imports resolve from the repo root.
