+# nw_common_tests
+
+**Package:** `nw-common-tests` (workspace member at `tests/`)  
+**Module:** `nw_common_tests`  
+**Role:** Dev-only pytest utilities shared across the monorepo — not for production deployables.
+
+Registered at the repo root via [`conftest.py`](../../../conftest.py) as `pytest_plugins = ["nw_common_tests.PytestHooks"]`, so every `uv run pytest` invocation gets consistent logging, TRACE support, and `NW_ENV=test`.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Architecture](#architecture)
+- [Module index](#module-index)
+- [Quick start](#quick-start)
+- [Dependencies](#dependencies)
+- [Modules](#modules)
+  - [Env — Test environment](#env--test-environment)
+  - [Fixtures — Shared fixtures](#fixtures--shared-fixtures)
+  - [Markers — Marker helpers](#markers--marker-helpers)
+  - [PytestHooks — Global pytest plugin](#pytesthooks--global-pytest-plugin)
+- [Testing](#testing)
+  - [Test layout](#test-layout)
+  - [Commands](#commands)
+  - [Notes](#notes)
+
+---
+
+## Architecture
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart TB
+    subgraph nw_common_tests [nw_common_tests]
+        Env[Env]
+        Fixtures[Fixtures]
+        Markers[Markers]
+        Hooks[PytestHooks]
+    end
+
+    subgraph consumers [Consumers]
+        RootConftest[repo conftest.py]
+        Packages[agent and lib test suites]
+    end
+
+    RootConftest --> Hooks
+    Hooks --> Env
+    Packages --> Fixtures
+    Packages --> Markers
+```
+
+---
+
+## Module index
+
+| Module | Description |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `Env` | Force `NW_ENV=test` for isolated test runs |
+| `Fixtures` | Shared pytest fixtures (e.g. FastAPI `TestClient` factory) |
+| `Markers` | Convenience wrappers for `smoke` and `regression` markers |
+| `PytestHooks` | Repo-wide pytest plugin: TRACE logging, log context, autouse env |
+
+Source files use Java-style PascalCase names aligned with this index.
+
+---
+
+## Quick start
+
+```python
+from nw_common_tests.Env import force_test_env
+from nw_common_tests.Fixtures import test_client_factory
+from nw_common_tests.Markers import smoke_marker, regression_marker
+
+force_test_env()  # sets NW_ENV=test if unset
+```
+
+No import is required for `PytestHooks` — root `conftest.py` loads it automatically.
+
+---
+
+## Dependencies
+
+| Dependency | Purpose |
+|------------|---------|
+| `nw-core` | `PYTEST_LOG_FORMAT`, `LogContextFilter`, TRACE level |
+| `pytest` | Fixtures, markers, hooks |
+| `fastapi`, `httpx` | `TestClient` factory fixture |
+
+---
+
+## Modules
+
+### Env — Test environment
+
+**File:** `Env.py`
+
+Sets `NW_ENV=test` via `os.environ.setdefault`, so components load `config/env.test` without mutating an existing value.
+
+```python
+from nw_common_tests.Env import force_test_env
+
+force_test_env()
+```
+
+Also applied automatically by the autouse fixture in `PytestHooks`.
+
+---
+
+### Fixtures — Shared fixtures
+
+**File:** `Fixtures.py`
+
+| Fixture | Returns |
+|---------|---------|
+| `test_client_factory` | Callable that wraps a FastAPI app in `TestClient` |
+
+```python
+def test_health(test_client_factory, app):
+    client = test_client_factory(app)
+    assert client.get("/health").status_code == 200
+```
+
+---
+
+### Markers — Marker helpers
+
+**File:** `Markers.py`
+
+| Function | Marker |
+|----------|--------|
+| `smoke_marker()` | `@pytest.mark.smoke` |
+| `regression_marker()` | `@pytest.mark.regression` |
+
+Root marker definitions live in the workspace [`pyproject.toml`](../../../pyproject.toml).
+
+---
+
+### PytestHooks — Global pytest plugin
+
+**File:** `PytestHooks.py`
+
+Registered as a pytest plugin (not imported directly in tests). Responsibilities:
+
+1. Register TRACE (level 5) at import time for `--log-cli-level=TRACE`
+2. Colour TRACE in pytest terminal output
+3. Apply `PYTEST_LOG_FORMAT` and `LogContextFilter` to pytest log handlers
+4. Autouse `NW_ENV=test` via `force_test_env`
+
+---
+
+## Testing
+
+### Test layout
+
+```
+tests/unit/
+├── EnvTest.py           # nw_common_tests.Env
+├── FixturesTest.py      # nw_common_tests.Fixtures
+├── MarkersTest.py       # nw_common_tests.Markers
+└── PytestHooksTest.py   # nw_common_tests.PytestHooks
+```
+
+### Commands
+
+From the `tests/` package directory:
+
+```bash
+cd tests
+uv run pytest unit/ -m unit
+```
+
+From the monorepo root:
+
+```bash
+uv run --package nw-common-tests pytest
+```
+
+### Notes
+
+- Built wheel includes only `src/nw_common_tests` (`hatchling` config in `tests/pyproject.toml`).
+- Pytest discovers `*Test.py` and `test_*.py` files.
+- `conftest.py` under `tests/feature/` is separate — it configures the YAML scenario suite, not this library.
